<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">RRK43.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Engiri Nk'oku Yaahandiikirwe Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">ENGIRI NK'OKU YAAHANDIIKIRWE</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Abantu baingi bakateeraho kuhandiika ebyabaireho ebyakozirwe omuriitwe, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />nk'oku twabigambiirwe abaabyereebeire butunu, bari abaheereza b'ekigambo kya Ruhanga okuruga obu byatandika. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:1">Byak 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Naanye, ku naaherize kukuratanisa byona nimbitondoora okuruga ahu byatandikiire, naareeba ku kishemereire kubikuhandiikira nk'oku byakurataine, iwe Teofilo ow'ekitiinisa, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />ngu obone kumanya gye amazima g'ebyo ebi waayegyesiibwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maraika okugambira Zaakaria ku arizaara Yohaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Omu busingye bwa Heroode omugabe w'Abayudaaya hakaba hariho omunyamurwa, eiziina rye Zaakaria, ow'omu kicweka kya Abiya; kandi akaba aine omukazi ow'omu baijukuru ba Arooni, eiziina rye Elizaabeesi. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Kandi bombi bakaba bari abahikiriire omu maisho ga Ruhanga, nibagyendera omu biragiro byona n'omu migyenzo yoona ebya Mukama bataine kamogo. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Kwonka bakaba bataine mwana, ahakuba Elizaabeesi akaba ari engumba, kandi bombi bakaba bakuzire munonga. <verse eid="LUK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ku yaabaire naakora omurimo gw'obunyamurwa omu maisho ga Ruhanga omu rubu rw'ekicweka kye, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />nk'emicwe y'obunyamurwa oku yaabaire eri, yaakwatwa enteenyu kuza kwotera <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obubaane n'amababi agu booteza, gakataamirana gye. </char></note>obubaane omuri hekalu. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Kandi omutwe gw'abantu gwona gukaba nigushabira aheeru omu shaaha egyo ey'okwotereramu obubaane. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Maraika wa Mukama yaamweyoreka, ayemereire aha rubaju rwa buryo rw'eitambiro ry'okwotereraho obubaane. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zaakaria ku yaamureebire, yaayekanga, yaatiina munonga. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Kwonka maraika yaamuhuumuriza, ati: Zaakaria, otatiina, ahakuba okushaba kwawe kuhuriirwe, Elizaabeesi omukazi waawe aryakuzaarira omwana w'omwojo, kandi oryamweta eiziina Yohaana.<verse eid="LUK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Oryashemererwa oyesiime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:14">Kandi baingi baryashemerererwa okuzaarwa kwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:3">Kub 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:4">Bar 13:4</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 13:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba aryaba mukuru omu maisho ga Mukama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:15">Tarinywa viinyo, n'obu kyakuba ekirikusinza kyona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:15">Kandi aryaijura Omwoyo Orikwera okuruga omunda ya nyina.<verse eid="LUK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Baingi omu Baisraeli aryabahindura, abagarure ahari Mukama Ruhanga waabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:5">4:5</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 4:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryagyendera omu maisho ga Ruhanga omu mwoyo gwa Eliya n'amaani ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:17">Okuhindura emitima y'abazaire, bakagarukana n'abaana baabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:17">N'abagomi okubagarura aha bwengye bw'abahikiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:17">Kandi n'okutebeekanisiza Mukama abantu abeeteekateekire.<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zaakaria yaabuuza maraika ati: Ekyo ndyakimanya nta ku kiri eky'amazima; ahabw'okuba ndi omugurusi, kandi n'omukazi wangye n'omukaikuru munonga. <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>. </char></note> Maraika yaamugarukamu ati: Niinye Gaburieli oyemerera omu maisho ga Ruhanga; kandi ntumirwe kugamba naiwe n'okukureetera ebigambo ebi ebirungi. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Mbwenu noija kuhunama, toribaasa kugamba, okuhitsya obu ebigambo ebi biribaho; ahabw'okuba tiwaikiriza ebi naakugambira, ebirihikiirizibwa omu bunaku bwabyo. <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Kandi abantu abaabaire bategyereize Zaakaria, baatangaarira oku yaasiiba omuri hekalu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ku yaashohoire, tiyaabaasa kugamba nabo; baamanya ku yaareeba okworekwa omuri hekalu; yaaguma naabagambisisa engaro, agobirwe orurimi. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Obunaku bw'okuheereza kwe ku bahweire, yaagaruka omuka. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ebiro ebyo ku byahingwireho, Elizaabeesi yaagira enda, yaamara ameezi ataano ayesherekire, naagira ati: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:23">Kut 30:23</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo Mukama angizire omu biro ebi andeebeiremu, kuunyihaho enshoni omu bantu.<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gaburieli okugambira Mariamu ku arizaara Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Omu kwezi kwa mukaaga maraika Gaburieli akatumwa Ruhanga omuri tauni ya Galilaaya erikwetwa Nazareesi, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:16-23">Mat 1:16-23</ref>. </char></note> aha mwishiki oshugaine, owaabaire naagambwa obugyenyi omushaija orikwetwa Yosefu, ow'omu nju ya Daudi; eiziina ry'omwishiki ogwo akaba ari Mariamu. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Gaburieli yaija ah'ari, yaamugambira ati: Shemererwa, iwe orikukundwa munonga! Mukama ari naiwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />We yaayekanga munonga ahabw'ekigambo ekyo, naateekateeka okuramutsya okwo oku kuri. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Maraika yaamuhuumuriza naagira ati: Otatiina, Mariamu, ahabw'okuba otungire obuganzi ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa 7:14</ref>. </char></note> Reeba oryagira enda, ozaare omwana w'omwojo, kandi oryamweta eiziina Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryaba mukuru, aryayetwa Omwana wa Rukira-boona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:32">Kandi Mukama Ruhanga aryamuta aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa ishenkuru Daudi,<verse eid="LUK 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 4:7">Mik 4:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ategyeke enju ya Yakobo ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:33">Kandi obukama bwe tiburihwaho.<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mariamu yaabuuza maraika ati: Ekyo kiryabaasika kita, ka ntaine mushaija? <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Maraika yaamugarukamu ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:35">Omwoyo Orikwera aryakwizira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:35">N'amaani ga Rukira-boona garyakusangira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:35">Omwana orizaarwa nikyo aryeterwa Orikwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:35">Omwana wa Ruhanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Kandi reeba, muhara waanyu Elizaabeesi nawe aine enda y'omwana w'omwojo omu bukaikuru bwe; owaabaire naayetwa engumba hati aine ameezi mukaaga. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nari: Ahabw'okuba tihariho kigambo kya Ruhanga ekibura amaani. </char></note>Ahabw'okuba tihariho ekirema Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mariamu yaagira ati: Reeba, ndi omuzaana wa Mukama; kimbeho nk'oku waagamba. Maraika yaamutsigaho, yaagyenda.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariamu okuzindukira Elizaabeesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Omu biro ebyo Mariamu yaimuka, yaayehuuta, yaaza omu nsi y'ebibungo omuri tauni ya Buyudaaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />yaataaha owa Zaakaria, yaaramutsya Elizaabeesi. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elizaabeesi, ku yaahuriire okuramutsya kwa Mariamu, omwana yaagurukaguruka omunda ye; Elizaabeesi yaijura Omwoyo Orikwera, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Omu bakazi boona niiwe ohairwe omugisha, n'omwana w'omu nda yaawe ahairwe omugisha! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nyowe eki kyandugira hi nyina wa Mukama wangye okuntaayaayira? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Reeba ku naahurira eiraka ry'okuramutsya kwawe, omwana yaagurukaguruka omunda yangye ahabw'okushemererwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Kandi ohairwe omugisha, iwe owaikiriize ku ebi waagambiirwe Mukama birihikiirizibwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam 2:1-10</ref>. </char></note> Mariamu yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">Amagara gangye nigahimbisa Mukama,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />N'omutima gwangye nigushemerererwa Ruhanga Omujuni wangye;<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Ahabw'okuba areebire obucureezi bw'omuzaana we.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Mbwenu reeba, okuruga hati ab'obusingye bwona baryanyeta ohairwe omugisha;<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Ahakuba Ow'obushoboorozi ankoreire bikuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">N'eiziina rye ni ryera.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 103:17">Zab 103:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Agirira embabazi abarikumutiina</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">Nk'oku obusingye bwihaihana.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:10">Zab 89:10</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 22:28">2 Sam 22:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ayorekire amaani n'omukono gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">Yaataataanisa abaine amaryo omu biteekateeko by'omu mitima yaabo;<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:52: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 147:6">Zab 147:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:11">Yob 5:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abingire ab'ekitiinisa aha bitebe byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">Yaatunguura abatakiine.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:53: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:9">Zab 107:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaine enjara abaigutsize ebirungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">N'abatungi yaababinga bataine kantu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Ahwereire Israeli omugaragwa we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">Naijuka embabazi ze,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Ezi yaaraganiise Abrahamu n'oruzaaro rwe ebiro n'ebiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">Nk'oku yaagambiire baatatenkuriitwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Okuruga aho Mariamu yaamara ameezi nk'ashatu na Elizaabeesi; bwanyima yaagaruka owaabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzaarwa kwa Yohaana Omubatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Obunaku bwa Elizaabeesi bw'okuzaara bwahika, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Batabani be na beene waabo baahurira ku Mukama amugiriire embabazi, baashemererwa hamwe nawe. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Aha kiro kya munaana baija kushara omwana; bakaba nibenda kumweta Zaakaria, nibamweterera ishe; <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />kwonka nyina yaayanga, naagira ati: Tikwo; ayetwe Yohaana. <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Baamugarukamu bati: Omuri beene waanyu tihariho n'omwe orikwetwa eiziina eryo. <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Baabuuzisa ishe engaro oku arikwenda kumweta. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Yaashaba eky'okuhandiikaho; yaahandiika ati, Eiziina rye ni Yohaana. Boona baatangaara. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ahonaaho akanwa ke kaiguka, n'orurimi rwe rwakomoroka, yaagamba naahimbisa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Bataahi baabo boona baagira obwoba; n'ebigambo ebyo byona byabuga omu nsi y'ebibungo ebya Buyudaaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Abaabihuriire boona baabitaasya omu mitima yaabo, nibeebuuza bati: Mbwenu omwana ogu aryaba ata? Ahakuba buzima omukono gwa Mukama gukaba guri hamwe nawe.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekyeshongoro kya Zaakaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Bwanyima Zaakaria ishe yaijura Omwoyo Orikwera, yaahanuura naagira ati:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />Mukama Ruhanga wa Israeli ahimbisibwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">Ahabw'okuba ataayaayiire abantu be, yaabacungura.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:69: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:2">Zab 18:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atwimukiize eihembe ry'okujunwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">Omu nju y'omugaragwa we Daudi,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />(Nk'oku yaagambire naaraba omuri baanabi be abarikwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:70">Abaabaire bariho iranaira).<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Okutujuna abazigu baitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">N'omu mikono y'abarikutwanga boona;<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:72: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:45">Zab 106:45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:42">Lev 26:42</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'okugirira baatatenkuriitwe embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">N'okwijuka endagaano ye erikwera,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:73: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:16">Kut 22:16</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Endahiro ei yaarahiire Abrahamu tatenkuriitwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:74: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 2:12">Tit 2:12</ref>, <ref loc="TIT 2:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ngu, ku turiheza kujunwa omu mikono y'abazigu baitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">Tubone kumuheereza tutaine ki turikutiina,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Turi abarikwera kandi abahikiriire omu maisho ge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">Ebiro byona eby'amagara gaitu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:76: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naiwe, Omwana, oryayetwa nabi wa Rukira-boona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Ahabw'okuba oryayembera Mukama okushemeza emihanda ye,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:77: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:34">Yer 31:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okumanyisa abantu be eby'okujunwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">Omu kusaasirwa ebibi byabo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:78: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 4:2">Mal 4:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okusaasira kwa Ruhanga waitu okwijwire embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Omushekye guryajuguta niguruga omu iguru, gutujwere,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:79: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okumurikira abatuura omu mwirima n'omu kibunda ky'okufa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">N'okushoronzya ebigyere byaitu omu muhanda gw'obusingye.<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Bwanyima omwana yaakura, yaayeyongyera amaani omu mutima; kandi yaaguma omu ihamba okuhitsya aha kiro eki yaayorekyeirweho Abaisraeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okuzaarwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Omu biro ebyo ekiragiro kikaruga ahari Kaisaari Augusto, nikiragiira ab'omu nsi yoona okwehandiikisa. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Okuhandiikwa okwo nikwo kw'okubanza okwabaireho, Kureenio naategyeka Siria. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Abantu boona baaza kwehandiikisa, buri muntu omuri tauni y'owaabo. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Na Yosefu yaaruga Galilaaya omuri tauni ya Nazareesi, yaataaha Buyudaaya omu rurembo rwa Daudi orurikwetwa Betelehemu, ahabw'okuba akaba ari ow'omuryango gw'oruganda rwa Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />yaaza kwehandiikisa na Mariamu, ou yaabaire naagamba obugyenyi, aine enda. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ku baabaire bakiri okwo, obunaku bwe bw'okuzaara bwahika; <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:25">Mat 1:25</ref>. </char></note> yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, yaamuta omu twenda tw'obwereere, yaamubyamya omu nju y'amatungo, ahabw'okubura omwanya omu nju y'abagyenyi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maraika okugambira abariisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Omu nsi egyo hakaba harimu abariisa abaabaire batuura omu ishwa, nibarinda amasyo gaabo nyekiro. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Haija maraika wa Mukama, yaayemerera haihi nabo, ekitiinisa kya Mukama kyabeehinguririza nikimurinkana, baatiina munonga. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Maraika yaabagira ati: Mutatiina; ahakuba mbareeteire ebigambo birungi eby'okushemererwa kwingi, okurihika aha bantu boona; <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />ahabw'okuba eki kiro Omujuni yaabazaarirwa omu rurembo rwa Daudi, niwe Kristo Mukama waitu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Aha niho muraabimanyire; nimwija kushanga omwana w'omwereere, ashwekirwe omu twenda tw'obwereere, abyamiibwe omu kihongore. <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ahonaaho hamwe na maraika ogwo haabaho omutwe gw'engabo z'omu iguru, nizihimbisa Ruhanga, nizigira ziti:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 2:14">Efe 2:14</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 2:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga aheebwe ekitiinisa ahaiguru omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">N'omu nsi obusingye bugirwe abantu abu ashemerereirwe munonga.<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Bwanyima baamaraika ku baarugireho, baagaruka omu iguru, abariisa baagambirana bati: Mwije tuze Betelehemu, tureebe ekibaireyo, eki Mukama yaatumanyisa. <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Baagyenda nibeehuuta, baashanga Mariamu na Yosefu, n'omwana w'omwereere abyami omu kihongore. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ku baamureebire, baabateekyerereza ebi baagambirwa aha mwana ogwo. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Abaabihuriire boona baatangaarira ebi baagambirwa abariisa. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:51">Luk 2:51</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Mariamu yaarinda ebyo byona, yaaguma naabiteekateeka omu mutima. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Abariisa baagarukayo, nibahimbisa Ruhanga, nibamusiimira ebigambo byona ebi baahurira, n'ebi baareeba, nk'oku baabigambirwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okusharwa kwa Yesu, n'okumurikirwa Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ebiro munaana ku byahingwireho, yaashwarwa, yaayetwa eiziina Yesu, riri eryagambirwe maraika, nyina atakagizire nda ye. <verse eid="LUK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:1-8">Lev 12:1-8</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ebiro by'okushemezibwa kwabo ku byahingwireho, nk'ebiragiro bya Musa oku biri, baamutwara Yerusaalemu kumumurikira Mukama, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:15">Kur 13:15</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku kyahandiikirwe omu biragiro bya Mukama, ngu Ekyetwa ekishaija kyona eky'omujigaijo kiryayetwa ekirikwera ahari Mukama; <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Lev 12:8</ref>. </char></note> n'okutamba ekitambo nk'oku kyaragiirwe omu biragiro bya Mukama ngu, obwiba bubiri nari shi enkombe nto biri. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:1">Isa 40:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuri Yerusaalemu hakaba harimu omushaija, eiziina rye Simeoni; omushaija ogwo akaba ari ohikiriire naatiina Ruhanga, ategyereize Okuhuumurizibwa kwa Israeli, kandi Omwoyo Orikwera akaba amuriho. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Akaba ashuuruuriirwe Omwoyo Orikwera ku atarifa atakareebire Kristo wa Mukama. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Yaatwarwa Omwoyo omuri hekalu; abazaire ba Yesu ku baamutaahizemu, ngu bamukorere nk'emigyenzo y'Ebiragiro oku eri, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeoni ogwo yaamukiikira omu mikono ye, yaahimbisa Ruhanga naagira ati:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />Mukama wangye, mbwenu waaza kureka omwiru waawe agyende n'obusingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">Nk'oku waagambire;<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ahakuba amaisho gangye gaareeba okujuna kwawe,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Oku waateekateekyeire omu maisho g'abantu boona,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:6">Isa 49:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuba omushana gw'okujwera Abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">N'okuha ekitiinisa ky'abantu baawe Israeli.<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Ishe na nyina baatangaarira ebyamugambwaho; <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Isa 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:23">1 Kor 1:23</ref>. </char></note> kandi Simeoni yaabashabira omugisha, yaagira Mariamu nyina ati: Reeba, omwana ogu yaateebwaho ngu baingi omu Baisraeli bagwe, kandi baingi baimukye, n'okuba ak'okureeberaho ak'okuhakanisibwa, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />ngu ebiteekateeko by'omu mitima ya baingi bishuuruurwe; (naiwe rurara eryakucumita omu mutima.)<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kandi hakaba hariho n'omukazi nabi, eiziina rye Anna, muhara wa Fanueli, ow'omu ruganda rwa Asheri, owaabaire ari omukaikuru munonga; ku yaashweirwe, yaamara na iba emyaka mushanju; <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />bwanyima yaamara endiijo myaka makumi munaana n'ena ari omufaakazi. Omukazi ogwo akaba ataruga omuri hekalu, aramya Ruhanga, naayesiibyakwo, kandi naashaba nyomushana na nyekiro. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:9">Isa 52:9</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaizire omu shaaha egyo, yaasiima Ruhanga, kandi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nari: yaagambira boona ebya Yesu abaabaire bategyereza okucungurwa kwa Yerusaalemu. </char></note>ab'omuri Yerusaalemu boona abaabaire bategyereza okucungurwa yaabagambira ebya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Abazaire ba Yesu, ku baaherize kuhikiiriza byona eby'omu biragiro bya Mukama, baagaruka Galilaaya omuri tauni y'owaabo Nazareesi. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Omwana yaakura, yaaguma naayeyongyera amaani, naijura obwengye, kandi embabazi za Ruhanga zaamugumaho.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutsigara Yerusaalemu akiri muto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:14-17">Kur 23:14-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abazaire ba Yesu bakaba baza Yerusaalemu buri mwaka aha bugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ku yaahikize emyaka ikumi n'ebiri y'obukuru, bainamukayo, nk'omucwe gw'obugyenyi oku gwabaire guri. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Bwanyima y'ebiro by'obugyenyi, ku baabaire nibagarukayo, omwana ogwo Yesu yaatsigara Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Abazaire be tibaakimanya; kwonka ahabw'okuteekateeka ngu yaagyenda n'omutwe gw'abo abu baabaire nibagaruka nabo, baagyenda orugyendo rw'eizooba ryona, bwanyima baamusherurira omuri beene waabo na bataahi baabo; <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />ku yaababuriire, baagaruka Yerusaalemu, nibamusherura. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Bwanyima y'ebiro bishatu, baamushanga omuri hekalu, ashutami ahagati y'abeegyesa, naabahurira, kandi naababuuza ebibuuzo; <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />abaamuhuriire boona, baatangaarira obwengye bwe n'ebi yaabaire naabagarukamu. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Abazaire be ku baamureebire, baatangaara; nyina yaamubuuza ati: Mwana wangye, ahanki otugizire oti? Reeba, nyowe na sho tukusherwire twine obusaasi. <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:16">Yoh 2:16</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagarukamu ati: Mubaire nimunsherurira ki? Timurikumanya ku nshemereire kuguma omu nju ya Tata? <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Kwonka bo tibaashoborokyerwa kigambo ekyo eki yaabagambira. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yaashuuma nabo, yaataaha Nazareesi, yaaguma naaboorobera; kandi nyina yaagumya ebigambo ebyo byona aha mutima gwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:52: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Enf 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Yesu yaayeyongyera kutunga obwengye n'okukora, naasiimwa Ruhanga n'abantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yohaana okutandika okwegyesa n'okubatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'etaano ogw'omu busingye bwa Tiberio Kaisaari, Pontio Pilaato obu yaabaire ari omutegyeki wa Buyudaaya, na Heroode ari ow'eishaza rya Galilaaya, n'omurumuna Filipo ari ow'eishaza rya Iturea na Tirakoniiti, na Lusania ari ow'eishaza rya Abileene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />kandi Ana na Kayaafa bari abanyamurwa abakuru, ekigambo kya Ruhanga kikaizira Yohaana mwene Zaakaria omu ihamba; <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mak 1:1-8</ref>. </char></note> yaagyenda omu byanga byona ebiri haihi na Yorudani, naabuurira okubatizibwa kw'okweteisa, ahabw'okusaasirwa ebibi. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa 40:3-5</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebigambo bya nabi Isaaya ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Eiraka ry'orikugambaira omu ihamba ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Mushemeze omuhanda gwa Mukama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Mugorore otuhanda twe.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Empanga zoona ziryaijuzibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Enshozi zoona n'ebibungo biryabandikwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Ebitegami biryagororwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">N'emihanda etaboneire eryabonezibwa,<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Kandi abantu boona baryareeba okujuna kwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohaana okuhabura abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:33">Mat 23:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yohaana yaagambira emitwe y'abantu abaizire kubatizibwa, ati: Imwe baana b'enjoka 'mwe, n'oha obahabwire kuhunga ekiniga ekirikwenda kwija? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mbwenu mwane ebyana ebishemereire abeeteisize, mutatandika kugamba omu mitima yaanyu ngu, Twine Abrahamu, niwe tatenkuriitwe. Ahakuba nyowe nimbagambira nti: Ruhanga naabaasa amabaare aga kugaihiramu Abrahamu abaijukuru. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Na mbwenu empango etairwe aha bitsintsi by'emiti; omuti gwona ogutarikwana byana birungi guryatemwa gunagwe omu muriro. <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Abantu baamubuuza bati: Mbwenu shi, tugire tuta? <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Oine amakanzu abiri, aheho otagiine; n'oine eby'okurya, nawe atwaze atyo. <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Abahooza nabo baija kubatizibwa, baamubuuza bati: Mwegyesa, itwe tugire tuta? <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Mutarihooza ebirikukira ebi mwaragiirwe. <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />N'abaserukare baamubuuza bati: Kandi shi itwe, tugire tuta? Yaabagarukamu ati: Mutarinyaga omuntu weena ahabw'okumutwaza amaani, nari okumutabaariza eby'ebishuba; ekindi mumarwe ebihembo byanyu.<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohaana okugambira abantu ebya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh 1:19-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu boona ku baabaire bategyereize n'amatsiko, baayebuuza omu mitima yaabo ebya Yohaana ngu shana akaaba ari Kristo, <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yohaana yaabagarukamu boona naabagira ati: Buzima nyowe nimbabatiza n'amaizi: kwonka nihaija kwija Orikunkiza amaani, kandi tinshemereire n'okuyuzya orukoba rw'enkaito ze; Ogwo aryababatiza n'Omwoyo Orikwera n'omuriro. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Orugari rwe ruri omu mukono gwe, aryayeyerera gye embuga ye, ahunikye oburo omu kitara kye, kandi ebishushunga abyotsye omu muriro ogutaraara.<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Kandi yaagaruka yaabahana ebindi bingi, naabuurira abantu ebigambo birungi. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Kwonka oweishaza Heroode, ku yaateisiibwe Yohaana ahabwa Herodia muka mwene ishe, n'ahabw'ebibi byona ebi Heroode yaabaire akozire, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />ahari ebyo byona yaayongyeraho n'eki, yaata Yohaana omu kihome.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okubatizibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:21-22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mak 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:32">Yoh 1:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu boona ku baaherize kubatizibwa, Yesu nawe yaabatizibwa; ku yaabaire naashaba, eiguru ryakinguuka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref>. </char></note> Omwoyo Orikwera yaamushuumaho nk'enkombe, omu kushushani ky'omubiri, n'eiraka ryayema omu iguru, nirigira riti: Niiwe Mwana wangye ou nkunda, kandi ou nshemerererwa munonga.<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baishenkuru ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:23-38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1:1-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu, obu yaatandika kwegyesa, akaba aine emyaka nka makumi ashatu; kandi abantu bakaba nibamuteekateekaho kuba mwene Yosefu, mwene Heeli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />owa Mataati, owa Leevi, owa Meleki, owa Yanai, owa Yosefu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />owa Matatia, owa Amosi, owa Nahumu, owa Esili, owa Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />owa Maati, owa Matatia, owa Semei, owa Yoseka, owa Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />owa Yohanaani, owa Reesa, owa Zerubabeeli, owa Shealatieli, owa Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />owa Meleki, owa Adi, owa Kosamu, owa Elemadamu, owa Eri, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />owa Yesu, owa Elieza, owa Yorimu, owa Mataati, owa Leevi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />owa Simeoni, owa Yuda, owa Yosefu, owa Yonamu, owa Eliakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />owa Meleya, owa Mena, owa Matata, owa Nasani, owa Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:22">Rus 4:22</ref>. </char></note> owa Yese, owa Obedi, owa Boazi, owa Salumooni, owa Nahasooni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />owa Aminadabu, owa Arani, owa Hezirooni, owa Pereezi, owa Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />owa Yakobo, owa Isaaka, owa Abrahamu, owa Teera, owa Nahori, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />owa Serugi, owa Reu, owa Pelegi, owa Eberi, owa Seela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />owa Kainani, owa Arufakisaadi, owa Sheemu, owa Noa, owa Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />owa Mesuseela, owa Enoka, owa Yaredi, owa Mahalaleeli, owa Kainani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:1-3">Kut 5:1-3</ref>. </char></note> owa Enosi, owa Seezi, owa Adamu, owa Ruhanga.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okwohibwa Sitaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1-13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mak 1:12</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Yesu akaruga Yorudani, aijwire Omwoyo Orikwera, yaatwarwa Omwoyo omu ihamba, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />yaamarayo ebiro makumi ana, naayohibwa Sitaane, atarikurya ky'okurya kyona omu biro ebyo; ku byahweireho, yaagira enjara. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Omwohi nikwo kumugambira ati: Ku oraabe ori Omwana wa Ruhanga, gambira eibaare eri rihindukye eby'okurya. <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Bir 8:3</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Kikahandiikwa ngu, Omuntu tatungwa by'okurya byonka. <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Omwohi yaagaruka yaamutembya, yaamworeka obugabe bwona obw'omu nsi yoona omu mwanya mukye, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />yaamugira ati: Niinyija kukuha obushoboorozi obu bwona n'ekitiinisa kyabwo; ahakuba nkabuheebwa, kandi mbuheereza ou nkunda weena. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo, ku oriname wandamya, bwona nibuba obwawe. <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Bir 6:13</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 6:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugarukamu naamugira ati: Kikahandiikwa ngu, Oramye Mukama Ruhanga waawe, obe niwe waaheereza wenka. <verse eid="LUK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Bwanyima yaamwinamura Yerusaalemu, yaamuta aha itungu rya hekalu, yaamugambira ati: Ku oraabe ori Omwana wa Ruhanga, ruga aha, ogurukye oyetsimbe ahansi; <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Zab 91:11</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba kikahandiikwa ngu, Aryaragiira baamaraika be, bakurinde; <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />kandi ngu: Baryakukwatirira omu mikono yaabo, ngu otakaahikiza ekigyere kyawe aha ibaare. <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Bir 6:16</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugarukamu naamugira ati: Kikagambwa ngu, Otaryosya Mukama Ruhanga waawe. <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:15">Heb 4:15</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Omwohi Sitaane, ku yaaherize byona ebi yaabaire naamwohesa, yaamurugaho, okuhitsya obu aribona ogundi mwanya. <verse eid="LUK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mak 1:14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Yesu yaagaruka Galilaaya aine amaani g'Omwoyo, okurangaanwa kwe kwabuga omu byanga byona ebiri haihi nayo, <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />yaayegyesa omuri sinagogi zaabo, boona baamusiima.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aba Nazareesi okwenda kwita Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16-30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mak 6:1-6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaataaha Nazareesi, ahu yaakuriire; ahari Sabato yaataaha omuri <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi n'ekanisa y'ekiyudaaya. </char></note>sinagogi, nk'omucwe gwe oku gwabaire guri. Yaimuka kushoma. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 61:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Baamuha ekitabo kya nabi Isaaya, yaakishuuruura, yaashanga ahu ekicweka kahandiikirwe ngu:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />Omwoyo wa Mukama ari ahariinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Ahakuba akanshukaho amajuta kubuurira abooro ebigambo ebirungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Yantuma kumanyisa enkwatwa eby'okurekurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">N'okumanyisa empumi eby'okuhumuurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">N'okurekura abarikwitwa kubi,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />N'okurangira abantu omwaka gwa Mukama ogw'embabazi. <verse eid="LUK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ku yaaherize kushoma, yaateerana ekitabo, yaakigarurira omuheereza, yaashutama; ab'omuri sinagogi boona baamugumyaho amaisho. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Yaatandika kubagambira ati: Eri izooba ebyahandiikirwe ebi byahikiirizibwa omu matu gaanyu. <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:42">Yoh 6:42</ref>. </char></note> Boona baamusiima, nibatangaarira ebigambo by'embabazi ebyaruga omu kanwa ke nibagira bati: Beitu ogu ti mwene Yosefu? <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yaabagira ati: Timuribura kuncwera enfumu egi muti: Iwe mufumu 'we, oyetambire! Byona ebi twahuriire ngu okakorera Kaperenaumu, bikorere n'aha omu nsi yaanyu. <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Yaabagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Tihariho nabi oikirizibwa omu nsi y'owaabo. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:9">1 Bag 17:9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:17">Yak 5:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nimbagambira omu mazima nti: Omu biro bya Eliya hakaba hariho abafaakazi baingi omuri Israeli; omu biro ebyo eiguru rikakingwa, enjura yaabura okumara emyaka eshatu n'ameezi mukaaga, haabaho enjara nyingi omu nsi yoona; <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />kwonka Eliya taratumirwe nangwa na hari omwe omuribo, kureka akatumwa aha mukazi omufaakazi owa Zarefaasi omu ishaza rya Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:14">2 Bag 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'omu biro bya nabi Elisha hakaba hariho ababembe baingi omuri Israeli; kwonka tihariho n'omwe owaashemeziibwe, kureka Naamani Omusiria. <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Ab'omuri sinagogi boona, ku baakihuriire, baagira ekiniga kingi; <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />baimuka, baamubinga omuri tauni, baamutwara nibamukurubana, baamuhitsya aha nengo y'ekibungo eki baabaire bombekireho tauni yaabo, ngu bamurengyezeho, abanzeyo omutwe. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Kwonka We yaaboogamu, yaagyenda.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okubinga daimoni Kaperenaumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:31-37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mak 1:21-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaashuuma yaaza omuri tauni ya Galilaaya erikwetwa Kaperenaumu. Ku yaabaire naabeegyesa ahari Sabato, <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:46">Yoh 7:46</ref>. </char></note> baatangaarira okwegyesa kwe, ahabw'okuba ekigambo kye kikaba kiine obushoboorozi. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Kandi omuri sinagogi egyo hakaba harimu omuntu owaabaire ariho daimoni; yaaborooga n'eiraka rihango ati: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />Ai bambe! Noofa ki naitwe, iwe Yesu owa Nazareesi; oizire kutucwekyereza? Ninkumanya; ori Orikwera wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu yaamugambira kubi, naagira ati: Hunama, murugyeho! Daimoni ku yaamuteire ahansi ahagati yaabo, yaamurugaho, ataine ki amwitsize. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Boona baatangaara, nibabuuzana bati: Eki ni kigambo ki? Naaragiira baadaimoni n'obushoboorozi n'amaani, baarugamu. <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Okurangaanwa kwe kwahika omu myanya yoona ehikaine n'ensi egyo.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza nyinazaara Simooni n'abandi barwaire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:38-44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-39">Mak 1:29-39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaimuka yaaruga omuri sinagogi, yaataaha omwa Simooni. Kandi nyinazaara Simooni akaba arwaire omushwija mwingi; baamweshengyereza kumukiza. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yaamwemerera aha rubaju, yaakabukira omushwija, gwamurugaho; ahonaaho yaimuka, yaabaheereza. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Eizooba ku ryabaire nirirengarenga, boona abaabaire barwarize abarwaire endwara zitari zimwe, baabamureetera; yaabataho engaro boona, yaabakiza. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:11">Mak 3:11</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 3:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Na baadaimoni baaruga omuri baingi, nibaamuza nibagira bati: Ori Omwana wa Ruhanga! Kwonka yaabagambira kubi, tiyaabaikiriza kugamba, ahabw'okuba bakamumanya ku ari Kristo.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Kandi ku bwaseesire, yaarugayo, yaaza omu mwanya ogwenagire. Abantu baamusherura, baija ah'ari, baayenda kumuzibira ngu atabarugaho; <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />kwonka yaabagira ati: Nshemereire kubuurira ebigambo ebirungi by'obukama bwa Ruhanga omuri tauni ezindi nazo; ahabw'okuba nikyo naatumiirwe. <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Yaaguma naabuurira engiri omuri sinagogi za Galilaaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Abeegi ba Yesu okukwata eby'enyanja bingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mak 1:16-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu ku yaabaire ayemereire aha rubaju rw'enyanja ya Genesareetei, omutwe gw'abantu baingi gwamufunza kuhurira ekigambo kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Yaareeba amaato abiri gari aha nkungu y'enyanja; kwonka abajubi bagarugiremu niboozya obutimba bwabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yaaza omuri bumwe obwabaire buri obwa Simooni, yaamushaba kubwirizayo hakye okuruga aha nkungu. Yaabushutamamu, yaayegyesa abantu. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Yoh 21:6</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize kugamba, yaagira Simooni, ati: Mwirire ahagati y'enyanja, mutegye obutimba bwanyu. <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simooni yaamugarukamu ati: Mwegyesa, turaire nitutega ekiro kyona, twabura eki twakwatsa. Kwonka ahabw'ekigambo kyawe, ka ntegye obutimba. <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Ku baakozire ekyo, baakwatsa eby'enyanja bingi munonga, obutimba bwabo bwayenda kucweka; <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />nikwo kwetesa bagyenzi baabo engaro bari omu bundi bwato ngu baije babahwere. Baija, baijuza amaato gombi, gaayenda kumirwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simooni Petero ku yaakireebire, yainama aha maju ga Yesu, yaagira ati: Ndugaho, Mukama wangye, ahabw'okuba ndi omusiisi. <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Ahakuba we na bagyenzi be boona bakatangaara ahabw'eby'enyanja bingi ebi baakwatsire. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Kandi Yakobo na Yohaana, beene Zebedaayo, abaabaire bakwataniise na Simooni, nabo baatangaara. Yesu yaagambira Simooni ati: Otatiina, okuruga hati oryajuba abantu. <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:27">Mat 19:27</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikize amaato gaabo aha nkungu, baatsigaho byona, baamukuratira.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okushemeza omubembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12-16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mak 1:40-45</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabaire ari omuri tauni emwe ahari ezo, haija omushaija oshwekirwe ebibembe; ku yaareebire Yesu, yaajuumara, yaamweshengyereza ati: Mukama wangye, ku oraabe nookunda, noobaasa kunshemeza. <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu yaagorora omukono, yaamukoraho, naagira ati: Ninkunda; shemera. Ahonaaho ebibembe byamurugaho. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 15:2-32">Lev 15:2-32</ref>. </char></note> Yaamwehenangiriza kutagira ou yaakigambira, ati: Kwonka irooko ogyende oyeyorekye aha munyamurwa, ohongye empongano ahabw'okushemezibwa kwawe, nk'oku Musa yaaragiire, kibe eky'okuhamya omu maisho g'abantu. <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Kwonka okurangaanwa kwe kwayeyongyera okukiraho kubuga hoona; n'emitwe mingi y'abantu yaateerana kuhurira n'okutambirwa endwara zaabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:35">Mak 1:35</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka We yaarugayo, yaaza omu ihamba, yaashaba.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza ozingazingirwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:17-26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mak 2:1-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro kimwe ahari ebyo, akaba naayegyesa; n'Abafarisaayo n'abeegyesa ab'Ebiragiro, abaarugire omu tauni zoona ez'omuri Galilaaya n'omuri Buyudaaya, na Yerusaalemu, bakaba bashutami aho; kandi amaani ga Mukama ag'okukiza gakaba gari hamwe nawe. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Ahonaaho haija abantu bareetsire omushaija ozingazingirwe, bamuheekire omu ngozi; baasherura oku baraamutaasye omu nju, bakamurambika omu maisho ga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ku baabuzire ah'okumurabya ahabw'omutwe gw'abantu, baatemba ahaiguru y'enju, baamurabya omu mategura, baamushuumiza omu ngozi ahagati y'abantu omu maisho ga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Ku yaareebire okwikiriza kwabo, yaagira ati: Mushaija 'we, ebibi byawe byakusaasirwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:25">Isa 43:25</ref>. </char></note> Abahandiiki n'Abafarisaayo baatandika kwetomboita, nibagira bati: ogu n'oha orikurogota? N'oha orikubaasa kusaasira ebibi kureka Ruhanga wenka? <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu ku yaamanyire okwetomboita kwabo, yaababuuza ati: Nimwetomboitera ki omu mitima yaanyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Ekirikurahuka kirahi, okugira nti, Ebibi byawe byakusaasirwa; nari okugira nti, Imuka, ogyende? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Mbwenu mumanye ngu, Omwana w'omuntu aine obushoboorozi aha nsi okusaasira ebibi, yaagambira ozingazingirwe ati: Ninkuragiira nti: Imuka, oyekorere engozi yaawe, otaahe. <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ahonaaho yaimuka omu maisho gaabo, yaayekorera eki yaabaire abyamiho, yaataaha omuka naahimbisa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Kyabatangaaza boona, baahimbisa Ruhanga, baine obwoba bwingi, nibagira bati: Eri izooba twareeba eby'okutangaaza.<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okweta Leevi omuhooza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:27-32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mak 2:13-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo, ku yaashohoire, yaareeba omuhooza orikwetwa Leevi, ashutami omu ihoorezo; yaamugira ati: Nkuratira! <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Yaatsigaho byona, yaimuka, yaamukuratira. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Leevi ogwo yaamuteekyera obugyenyi bwingi omu nju ye; kandi hakaba hariho omutwe mwingi gw'abahooza n'abandi bashutami nabo aha by'okurya. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Abafarisaayo n'abahandiiki baabo baayetomboitera abeegi be nibagira bati: Ahabw'enki nimurya kandi nimunywa n'abahooza n'abasiisi? <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Abahuriire tibeetenga mufumu, kureka abarwaire. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Tindaizire kweta bahikiriire kureka abasiisi ngu beeteise. <verse eid="LUK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33-39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mak 2:18-22</ref>. </char></note> Baamugambira bati: Abeegi ba Yohaana kaingi beesiibyakwo, kandi bashaba; n'Abafarisaayo nabo nikwo bakora; kwonka abaawe barya kandi banywa. <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu yaababuuza ati: Nimubaasa muta kusiibyakwo abakwe, bakiine kishwera? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Obunaku buryahika, kishwera abaihweho; omu biro ebyo baryayesiibyakwo. <verse eid="LUK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Kandi yaabacwera enfumu, ati: Tihariho muntu otaagura ekiremu aha kijwaro kisya, akakiteera aha kijwaro kikuru; ku yaakukora atyo, akaataagura ekyo kijwaro kisya, kandi ekiremu eki yaataagura aha kisya tikikaashushana n'ekijwaro ekikuru. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Kandi tihariho muntu oshuka viinyo nsya omu furebe z'empu nkuru; ku yaakukora atyo, viinyo ekaabarura efurebe, viinyo egyo eyatika, n'efurebe zisiisikara. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Kureka viinyo nsya eshemereire kushukwa omu furebe nsya. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Kandi tihariho muntu owaanyweire ahari viinyo nkuru, akakunda ensya; ahakuba naagira ati: Enkuru niyo nungi.<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Mukama wa Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1-5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mak 2:23-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro kya Sabato akaba naaraba omu misiri y'oburo; abeegi be baacwa obushiisha bw'oburo, baabujungirira omu ngaro zaabo, baaburya. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Kwonka abamwe aha Bafarisaayo baabuuza bati: Ahabw'enki nimukora ekirikuzira, okucwa obushiisha ahari Sabato? <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Beitu shi, timukashomaga eki Daudi yaakozire, obu yaagira enjara, we n'abu yaabire aine? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lev 24:9</ref>. </char></note> Akataaha omu nju ya Ruhanga, yaakwata emigaati ey'okumurikwa, yaagiryaho, kandi yaagihaho n'abu yaabaire aine, haza kiri eki Ebiragiro byabaire bizibira omuntu weena kukora, kureka abanyamurwa bonka. <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yaabagira ati: Omwana w'omuntu niwe Mukama wa Sabato.<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza omuntu okokootsire omukono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:6-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mak 3:1-6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahari Sabato endiijo yaataaha omuri sinagogi, yaayegyesa; hakaba harimu omuntu okokootsire omukono gwa buryo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:1">Luk 14:1</ref>. </char></note> Abahandiiki n'Abafarisaayo baamutaho amaisho kureeba yaaba araamukize ahari Sabato, ngu babone eki baraamuregye. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Kwonka yaamanya ebiteekateeko byabo, yaagambira omuntu ogwo, owaabaire akokootsire omukono, ati: Imuka oyemerere aha. Yaimuka, yaayemerera aho. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Nimbabuuza, ahari Sabato Ebiragiro biikiriza okukora gye nari okukora kubi, okukiza amagara g'omuntu nari okugahwerekyereza? <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yaabuzya amaisho omuri boona, yaamuragiira ati: Nanuura omukono gwawe. Yaagunanuura, omukono gwe gwakira. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Abafarisaayo baagwa eiraro, baahanuura bonka oku baraakore Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutoorana entumwa 12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12-16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mak 3:13-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo yaatemba omu bibungo kushaba; yaaseesezayo ekiro naashaba Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mat 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:70">Yoh 6:70</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:13">Byak 1:13</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwaseesire, yaayeta abeegi be, yaatoorana omuribo ikumi na babiri, abu yaayetsire entumwa; <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simooni ou yaayetsire Petero, Anderea omurumuna, Yakobo, Yohaana, Filipo, Batolomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo, Tomasi, Yakobo mwene Alifaayo, Simooni orikwetwa Zelote, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda mwene Yakobo, na Yuda Iskaryota owaamureebize.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:17-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23-5:1">Mat 4:23—5:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-12">Mak 3:7-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaashuuma nabo, yaayemerera aharinganiire n'omutwe mwingi gw'abeegi be n'abantu baingi abaarugire omuri Buyudaaya yoona na Yerusaalemu, n'ab'omu mashaza ga Tuuro na Sidoni, haihi n'enyanja empango, abaizire kumuhurira n'okutambirwa endwara zaabo; <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />n'abaabaire bariho baadaimoni baakizibwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Ab'omu mitwe egyo boona baayenda ngu bamukoreho, ahabw'okuba amaani gakamurugamu, gaabakiza boona.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaine omugisha oku bari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:20-23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:3-12">Mat 5:3-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaimutsya amaisho, yaareeba abeegi be, yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Mwine omugisha, imwe abooro, ahabw'okuba obukama bwa Ruhanga n'obwanyu. <verse eid="LUK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:16-17">Kush 7:16-17</ref>. </char></note> Mwine omugisha, imwe abaine enjara hati, ahabw'okuba muryahaaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Mwine omugisha, imwe abarikurira hati, ahabw'okuba muryasheka.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 15:9">Yoh 15:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwine omugisha abantu ku baraabangye, baababinga, baabajuma, baacamura eiziina ryanyu ngu ni ribi, nibabatura Omwana w'omuntu.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Aha kiro ekyo mushemererwe, mugurukye ahabw'okwesiima; ahabw'okuba ebihembo byanyu ni bingi omu iguru; ahakuba nikwo baishenkurubo baagizire batyo baanabi.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 5:1">Yak 5:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka imwe abatungi, muryakareeba, ahabw'okuba muherize kuheebwa eby'okubahuumuza. <verse eid="LUK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Muryakareeba, imwe abahaagire hati mbwenu, ahabw'okuba muryagira enjara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:25">Muryakareeba, imwe abarikusheka hati mbwenu, ahabw'okuba muryarira muboroogye.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 4:4">Yak 4:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muryakareeba, abantu boona ku baribagambaho gye; ahabw'okuba nikwo baishenkurubo baagizire batyo baanabi ab'ebishuba.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emicwe mirungi ey'Abakristaayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:27-36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:39-48">Mat 5:39-48</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka nimbagambira imwe abarikuhurira nti: Mukunde abazigu baanyu, mukorere gye abarikubanga; <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />mushabire omugisha abarikubakyeena, mushabire abarikubaitsa omwaga. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Orikuteera oruhi rw'omushaya, omuhindurire ogundi; n'orikwaka ekanzu yaawe, n'omunagiro gwawe otarigumwima. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Orikushaba weena, omuhe; n'orinyaga ebintu byawe, otarigaruka kubimushaba. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat 7:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nk'oku mwenda abantu kubagirira, naimwe mube nikwo mwabagirira. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Mbwenu ku muraabe nimukunda abarikubakunda, nimusiimwaho ki? Ahakuba abasiisi nabo bakunda ababakunda. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Kandi ku muraakorere gye ababakorera gye, nimusiimwaho ki? Ahakuba n'abasiisi nikwo bakora. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Kandi ku muraabe nimuguza abo, abu mwineho amatsiko, ngu nyentsya naimwe babahe, nimusiimwaho ki? N'abasiisi baguza abasiisi, ngu baihurwe ebirikwingana n'ebi baagurize. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Kureka mukunde abazigu baanyu, mubakorere gye, mubaguze mutaineyo matsiko; obwo ebihembo byanyu biryaba bingi, kandi muryaba abaana ba Rukira-boona; ahabw'okuba We akorera gye abatasiima n'ababi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Mugire embabazi, nka Shoimwe oku agira embabazi.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:37-49: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:24">Mat 4:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutaricwa orubanja, naimwe timurirucwerwa; mutarisingisiriza, naimwe timurisingisirizibwa; musaasire, naimwe muryasaasirwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Muhe, naimwe muryaheebwa; endengo enungi, eigatiirwe, ecugutsiibwe, erikusheeshekara, niyo murirengyerwa omu bifuba byanyu, ahabw'okuba endengo ei murengamu naimwe niyo murirengyerwamu.<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat 15:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaabacwera enfumu ati: Empumi neebaasa eta kwebembera endiijo? Zombi tizirigwa omu kiina? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:20">Yoh 15:20</ref>. </char></note> Omwegi takira mwegyesa we; kwonka omwegi weena ku arihikiiriza eby'okwega, aryaba nk'omwegyesa we. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Ahabw'enki nooreeba akatokoozi akari omu riisho rya mugyenzi waawe, haza empimbi eri omu riisho ryawe otagyeteho? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Nari shi, noobaasa ota kugambira mugyenzi waawe oti: Mugyenzi wangye, ka nkutokoore akantu akari omu riisho ryawe, haza obwo bwona otarikureeba empimbi eri omu riisho ryawe? Iwe ndyarya 'we, banza oihe empimbi omu riisho ryawe, obwo nibwo oraareebe gye, okatokoora akantu akari omu riisho rya mugyenzi waawe. <verse eid="LUK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Tihariho muti murungi ogwana ebyana bibi; kandi tihariho muti mubi ogwana ebyana birungi. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Omuti gwona gumanyirwa aha byana byagwo. Nimumanya ngu abantu tibashoroma mitiini aha minyinya, n'obu yaakuba emizaabibu aha matojo. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat 12:34</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:35">35</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu murungi aiha ebirungi omu ibiikiro rirungi ery'omu mutima gwe; kandi omuntu mubi aiha ebibi omu ibiikiro rye eribi; ahakuba ebiijwire omutima akanwa nibyo kagamba.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 1:6">Mal 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muunyetera ki, Mukama wangye, Mukama wangye! Haza mutakora bi mbaragiira? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Omuntu weena orikwija ahi ndi, akahurira ebigambo byangye, akabihikiiriza, naaza kubooreka ou arikushusha; <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />naashusha omuntu owaayombekire enju, akarima hare munonga, akata omusingi aha rukiri; amaizi gaateera enju egyo, tigaabaasa kugitengyetsa, ahabw'okuba ekombekwa gye. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Kwonka orikuhurira, akanga kukora, naashusha omuntu owaayombekire enju aha itaka, atarimire musingi; amaizi gakagiteera, ahonaaho yaagwa; n'okugwa kw'enju egyo kwaba kuhango.<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza omuhuuku w'omukuru w'abaserukare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1-10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu ku yaaherize kugambira abantu ebigambo bye byona, yaataaha Kaperenaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Okwo hakaba hariyo omukuru w'abaserukare, owaabaire aine omuhuuku ou arikukunda munonga; omuhuuku ogwo akaba arwaire, ari haihi n'okufa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Ku yaahuriire ebya Yesu, yaamutumaho abakuru b'Abayudaaya, naamushaba kwija kukiza omuhuuku we. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Abatumirwe, ku baahikire ahari Yesu, baamweshengyereza munonga, bati: Omuntu ogwo ashemereire kukorerwa ekyo; <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />ahabw'okuba akunda eihanga ryaitu, kandi niwe yaatwombekyeire sinagogi yaitu. <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu nikwo kugyenda nabo. Ku yaabaire yaahika haihi n'enju, omukuru w'abaserukare yaatuma banywani be, ngu bamubugane, bamugambire ebi yaamutumaho, naagira ati: Mukama wangye, oteerusya kwija; ahakuba nyowe tikimpikire iwe kutaaha omu nju yangye; <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />n'ahabw'ekyo naareeba ngu tinshemereire kweizira; haakiri ogambe ekigambo kwonka, omuhuuku wangye abone kukira. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kandi ati: Manya naanye ndi omuntu orikutwarwa, kandi nyine abaserukare abu ndikutegyeka. Ku ndagiira omwe nti, Gyenda, agyenda; n'ondiijo nti, Ija, aija; n'omuhuuku wangye nti, Kora eki, akikora. <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu ku yaakihuriire, yaamutangaarira, yaahindukira omutwe gw'abantu abamukuratiire, yaabagira ati: Nimbagambira nti: Tinkareebaga kwikiriza okurikwingana kuti, n'obu haakuba omuri Israeli. <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Abo abatumirwe, ku baagarukire omuka, baashanga ogwo muhuuku yaakizire.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzoora omwana w'omufaakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ku haahingwireho omwanya mukye, yaagyenda omuri tauni erikwetwa Naini, ari hamwe n'abeegi be n'omutwe muhango gw'abantu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Ku yairiire haihi n'eirembo rya tauni, yaabugana abarikushohoza omutumbi gw'omwojo ofiire, ou nyina yaazaire ari omwe nyamunegyere, kandi nyina akaba ari omufaakazi; abantu abaingi ab'omuri tauni bakaba bari hamwe nawe. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Mukama waitu ku yaamureebire, yaamugirira esaasi, yaamugira ati: Otarira. <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Yairira haihi, yaakora aha katanda, abeekorezi baayemerera. Yaagira ati: Mwojo 'we, ninkugira nti: Imuka. <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:23">1 Bag 17:23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:36">2 Bag 4:36</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo owaaba afiire yaashutama, yaatandika kugamba. Yesu yaamuha nyina. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Boona baakwatwa obwoba, baahimbisa Ruhanga nibagira bati: Nabi omukuru aimukire omuriitwe. Kandi bati: Ruhanga ataayaayiire abantu be. <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Okurangaanwa kw'ekyo eki yaakozire kwabuga Buyudaaya yoona n'ebyanga byona ebigyehinguririize.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohaana Omubatizi okushobooroza ebya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:18-35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi abeegi ba Yohaana baamugambira ebyo byona. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Yohaana nikwo kweta babiri aha beegi be, akabatuma ahari Mukama waitu, naabuuza ati: Niiwe Ogwo orikwenda kwija, nari tutegyereze ondiijo? <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Abashaija abo ku baamuhikire, baagira bati: Yohaana Omubatizi yaatutuma kukubuuza, naagira ati: Niiwe Ogwo orikwenda kwija, nari tutegyereze ondiijo? <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Omu shaaha egyo yaakiza baingi endwara n'enaku na baadaimoni; kandi n'empumi nyingi yaazihumuura. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaagarukamu naabagira ati: Mugarukyeyo; mugambire Yohaana ebi mwareeba n'ebi mwahurira; empumi zihumwirwe, ebirema nibigyenda, ababembe bashemeziibwe, ebifa-matu nibihurira, abafu bazoirwe, n'abooro babuuriirwe ebigambo ebirungi. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Kandi otarikumbanganisaho aine omugisha.<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuhamya Yohaana Omubatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Bwanyima, entumwa za Yohaana ku zaaherize kugarukayo, Yesu yaatandika kugambira emitwe y'abantu ebya Yohaana, ati: Omu ihamba mukaza kureebayo ki? Orubingo orurikutengyetsibwa omuyaga? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Beitu mukaza kureeba ki? Omuntu ojwaire emyenda erikuterera? Manya abajwara ebijwaro ebirikwengyengyeta, bakeegira gye, baba omu bikaari by'abagabe. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Beitu mukaza kureebayo ki? Nabi? Eego, nimbagambira nti: N'okukira naakirira kimwe nabi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ogwo niwe yaahandiikirweho ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">Reeba, nintuma entumwa yangye, ekubandize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">Niyo erishemeza omuhanda gwawe.<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Nimbagambira nti: Omuri abo abaazairwe abakazi tiharimu n'omwe orikukira Yohaana Omubatizi obukuru; kwonka omuto omu bukama bwa Ruhanga naamukira. <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat 21:32</ref>. </char></note> (Abantu boona n'abahooza, abaabatiziibwe Yohaana ku baakihuriire, baahamya ku Ruhanga ahikiriire; <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:46">Byak 13:46</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Abafarisaayo n'abeegyesa ab'Ebiragiro, abatarabatiziibwe Yohaana, baayanga enaama ei Ruhanga yaabateekateekyeire.) <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Mbwenu abantu ab'ebiro ebi mbagyeranise na ki? Kandi nibashusha ki? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Nibashusha nk'abaana abato abashutami omu katare, nibeetana bati: Tubateereire esheegu, timwazina; twacura, timwarira! <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Ahakuba Yohaana Omubatizi akaija atarikurya mugaati, n'obu kwakuba okunywa viinyo; mwagira ntu, Ariho daimoni. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Kwonka Omwana w'omuntu we ku yaizire naarya, kandi naanywa, mwagira ngu, Reeba omunyamururu kandi omusinzi, munywani w'abahooza n'abasiisi. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Kwonka obwengye buhamibwa abaana baabwo boona ku buhikire.<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukazi omusiisi okusiiga Yesu amajuta aha bigyere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 11:37">Luk 11:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwe aha Bafarisaayo yaamweta kurya nawe; yaataaha omu nju ye, baashutama aha by'okurya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Omukazi omusiisi w'omuri tauni egyo, ku yaamanyire ngu ari aha by'okurya omw'Omufarisaayo, yaareeta eihembe ry'amajuta ag'omugaju, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7-13">Mat 26:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3-8">Yoh 12:3-8</ref>. </char></note> yaamwemerera enyima aha bigyere naarira; yaatandika kubijubya n'amarira, yaabiragaza n'eishokye rye, yaabinywegyera, yaabisiiga amajuta ago. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Omufarisaayo owaamwetsire, ku yaakireebire, yaateekateeka ati: Omuntu ogu, kuri yaaba ari nabi, akaamanyire omukazi ogu orikumukoraho oku ari, ku ari omusiisi. <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu yaagarukamu naamugira ati: Simooni, nyine eki ndikwenda kukugambira. Yaagira ati: ngambira, Mwegyesa. <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Hakaba hariho omuntu owaabaire aguza; akaba aine abu yaagurize babiri, omwe naamwihuza edenaari magana ataano, n'ondi makumi ataano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ku baabuzire eby'okumwihura, yaabasaasira bombi. Mbwenu ahari abo bombi, owaakizire kumukunda n'oha? <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simooni yaagarukamu naagira ati: Ningira ngu, n'ogwo ou yaasaasiire bingi. Yesu yaamugira ati: Waagarukamu gye. <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Yesu yaahinduka, yaareeba omukazi, yaagira Simooni ati: Nooreeba omukazi ogu? Naataaha omu nju yaawe, tiwampa maizi g'okunaaba ebigyere byangye, kwonka we yaajubya ebigyere byangye n'amarira ge, yaabisiisiriza n'eishokye rye. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Iwe tiwaanywegyera, kwonka we, okwiha obu naahika aha, takarekire kunywegyera bigyere byangye; <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />tiwansiiga majuta aha mutwe, kwonka we yaasiiga bigyere byangye amajuta. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />N'ahabw'ekyo ninkugambira nti: Ebibi bye bingi yaabisaasirwa, ahabw'okuba okukunda kwe ni kwingi; kwonka osaasirwa ebikye, okukunda kwe ni kukye. <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yaagira ogwo mukazi ati: Ebibi byawe byakusaasirwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Abaabaire bashutami nibarya nawe baatandika kubuuzana bati: Ogu n'oha kandi orikusaasira ebibi? <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:48">Luk 8:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:19">17:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:42">18:42</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaagambira omukazi ati: Okwikiriza kwawe nikwo kwakujuna; gyenda n'obusingye.<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Abakazi abaabaire baheereza Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ku haahingwireho omwanya mukye, yaagyendagyenda omuri tauni n'ebirorero naabuurira kandi naagamba ebigambo ebirungi by'obukama bwa Ruhanga. Obwo akaba aine bari ikumi na babiri, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:40">Mak 15:40</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9">16:9</ref>. </char></note> hamwe n'abakazi bamwe abaakiziibwe baadaimoni n'obumuga, Mariamu Magadaleene, owaarugirweho baadaimoni mushanju, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />na Yoana muka Cuuza omubiiki wa Heroode, na Susaana, n'abandi baingi abaabaire nibabahwera n'ebintu byabo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'omubibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:4-15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1-23">Mat 13:1-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-20">Mak 4:1-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omutwe muhango gw'abantu abaarugire omuri tauni zoona bakateeranira ah'ari, yaabacwera enfumu ati: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />Omubibi akashohora kubiba; ku yaabaire naabiba, embibo zimwe zaagwa omu muhanda, zaaribatiirirwa, enyonyi z'omu mwanya zaazirya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ezindi zaagwa aha rukiri; ku zaamezire, zaahonga, ahabw'okubura amaizi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ezindi zaagwa omu mahwa; amahwa gaakura nazo, gaazinyuruza. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ezindi zaagwa omu itaka rirungi, zaamera, zaayera emirundi igana. Ku yaaherize kugira atyo, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Oine amatu agarikuhurira, ahurire.<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Abeegi ku baamubuurize amakuru g'enfumu egyo, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref>. </char></note> yaagira ati: Imwe muhairwe okumanya emibonano y'obukama bwa Ruhanga, kwonka abandi bagigambirwa omu nfumu, ngu omu kuhurira barekye kushoborokyerwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:23">1 Pet 1:23</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu enfumu egyo niyo egi. Embibo n'ekigambo kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Ez'omu muhanda, abo nibo bahurira; bwanyima Sitaane akiija, akaiha ekigambo omu mitima yaabo, ngu bataikiriza bakajunwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Ez'aha rukiri, abo nibo bahurira ekigambo, bakakiikiriza n'okushemererwa; kwonka bataine mizi, bakaikiriza omwanya mukye, kandi omu biro eby'okwohibwa bakagaruka enyima. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Ezaagwire omu mahwa, abo nibo bahurira; kwonka bakiba bari omu muhanda bakanyuruzibwa amaganya g'ensi, n'obutungi n'okweshemeza okw'amagara g'ensi egi, ebyana byabo biteere. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:10">Kush 3:10</ref>. </char></note> N'ezaagwire omu itaka rirungi, abo nibo bahurira ekigambo, bakakigumya omu mitima eshemeire emirungi, kandi bakaguma nibaana ebyana.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'etabaaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16-18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mak 4:21-25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihariho okongyeza etabaaza, akagijuumikira ekiibo, nari shi okugita omunda y'ekitanda, kureka agita aha kikondo kyayo, ngu abarikutaahamu bareebe okwaka kwayo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10:26</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Ahakuba tihariho kyasherekirwe ekitarishuuruurwa, nari eky'omubonano ekitarimanywa kikareebwa butunu. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19:26</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omu kuhurira mwerinde, ahabw'okuba oine, niwe aryongyerwa, kandi otaine, aryayakwa n'ekyo eki arikuteekateeka ngu aine.<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Beene waabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:19-21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mak 3:31-35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nyina n'abarumuna baija ah'ari, tibaabaasa kumuhika ahabw'omutwe gw'abantu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Abaabaire bari aho baamugira bati: Nyoko n'abarumuna baawe beemereire aheeru, nibenda kukureeba. <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />We yaabagarukamu naagira ati: Maawe n'abarumuna bangye n'abo abahurira ekigambo kya Ruhanga, bakakyorobera.<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okucureeza enyanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:22-25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:18">Mat 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:27">23:27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mak 4:35-41</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro kimwe ahari ebyo akaza omu bwato n'abeegi be, yaabagira ati: ka twambukye seeri y'enyanja. Baagyenda. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Ku baabaire nibagyenda, yaagwejegyera. Eihunga ringi ryabatangira aha nyanja, obwato bwayenda kwijura amaizi, baaba omu kabi. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Baija baamusisiimura, nibagira bati: Mwegyesa, Mwegyesa, twafa! Yaasisiimuka, yaakabukira eihunga n'okuhoorera kw'amaizi; byacureera, haabaho obucureera bwingi. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yaababuuza ati: okwikiriza kwanyu kuri nkahi? Baatiina, baatangaara, baagambirana bati: Ogu ni muntu ki, orikuragiira eihunga n'enyanja, bikamuhurira!<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okubinga baadaimoni aha muntu wa Geraseene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:26-39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mak 5:1-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batyo baahika omu nsi y'Abageraseene, eteegaine na Galilaaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ku yaatambuukiire ati aha nkungu, yaabuganwa omushaija ow'omuri tauni yaaho, owaabaire ariho daimoni. Omushaija ogwo akaba amazire ebiro bingi atakijwara kantu, kandi atakiraara mu nju kureka omu bituuro. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Ku yaareebire Yesu, yaayamuza, yaamugwa omu maisho, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Noofa ki naanye, Yesu Omwana wa Ruhanga Rukira-boona? Ninkweshengyereza, otaanyita kubi; <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />ahabw'okuba Yesu akaba yaaragiire daimoni kuruga aha muntu ogwo. (Kandi kaingi daimoni ku yaabaire amukwata, abantu bamubohesa emihama n'emirunga ngu bamurinde; acwa ebimubohire, daimoni amurariza omu ihamba.) <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu yaamubuuza ati: Eiziina ryawe ori oha? Yaamugarukamu ati: ndi Legioni; ahakuba baadaimoni baingi bakaba bamutaahiremu. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Baamweshengyereza kutabaragiira kukyengyera okuzimu. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Kandi aho omu rukiizi hakaba hariiriireyo omukumbi gw'empunu nyingi; baamweshengyereza kuba nizo baataahamu. Yaabaikiriza. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Baadaimoni nikwo kuruga omu muntu ogwo, bakataaha omu mpunu; empunu ezo zoona zikashuuma ibanga niziiruka, zikahwera omu nyanja.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Abariisa baazo ku baareebire ekyabaho, bairuka, baabigambira ab'omuri tauni n'ab'omu byaro. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Abantu baahurura kureeba ebyabaho; ku baahikire ahari Yesu, baashanga omushaija owaarugwaho baadaimoni ashutami aha bigyere bya Yesu, ajwaire gye, aine obwengye; baatiina. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Abariisa abaabireeba, baabateekyerereza oku owaabaire ariho baadaimoni yaakizibwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Abantu boona ab'omu nsi egyo ey'Abageraseene baamushaba kubarugamu; ahabw'okuba bakakwatwa obwoba bwingi; atyo Yesu yaaza omu bwato, yaagarukayo. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Atakagyenzire, omushaija owaarugwaho baadaimoni yaamweshengyereza ngu agume nawe; kwonka Yesu yaamwohereza, naagira ati: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />Garuka omu ka yaawe, ogambe ebi Ruhanga yaakukorera oku biri bikuru. Yaagyenda naabuzya omuri tauni yoona ebikuru ebi Yesu amukoreire.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza omukazi orwaire ekyejwiso, n'okuhimbuura omwana wa Yairo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:40-56: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mak 5:21-43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu ku yaagarukireyo, omutwe gw'abantu gwamutangirira n'okushemererwa, ahakuba boona bakaba bamutegyereize. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Haija omushaija eiziina rye Yairo, owaabaire ari omukuru wa sinagogi; yaakwata Yesu amaguru, naamweshengyereza kuza omu nju ye, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />ahabw'okuba akaba aine omwishiki omwe wenka ohikize emyaka ikumi n'ebiri, kandi akaba ari haihi n'okufa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Ku yaabaire naagyenda, abantu baamufunza. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Haija omukazi owaabaire amazire emyaka ikumi n'ebiri arwaire ekyejwiso; kandi akaba yaamariire ebintu bye byona omu bafumu, kwonka hatariho n'omwe owaabaasize kumutambira. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Yaamuturuka enyima, yaakora aha mukugiro gw'ekijwaro kye; ahonaaho ekyejwiso kye kyakira. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu yaabuuza ati: N'oha owankoraho? Boona ku baayehakaine, Petero na bagyenzi be baamugira bati: Mwegyesa, emitwe ekwehinguririize, neekumigisiriza! <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Yesu yaagira ati: Haine owankoraho, ahabw'okuba naahurira amaani gandugamu. <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Omukazi ku yamanyire ngu tasherekirwe, yaija naatetema, yaajuumara omu maisho ge, yaagambira omu maisho ga boona ekyamumukoresaho, kandi n'oku yaakira ahonaaho. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Mwana wangye, okwikiriza kwawe nikwo kwakukiza; gyenda n'obusingye.<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ku yaabaire naakigamba, haija omuntu owaaruga ow'omukuru wa sinagogi, yaagira ati: Muhara waawe yaakaba; otarusya Omwegyesa. <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Kwonka Yesu ku yaakihuriire, yaamugambira ati: Otatiina; ikiriza kwonka, naija kukira. <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ku yaahikire aha nju, tiyaikiriza muntu weena kutaahamu nawe, kureka Petero na Yohaana na Yakobo na ishe w'omwishiki na nyina. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Kandi boona bakaba nibarira nibamucurira; kwonka Yesu yaabagira ati: Mutarira; ahabw'okuba tafiire, agwejegyeire. <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Bamushekyerera munonga, ahabw'okuba bakamanya ku afiire. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />We yaamukwata aha mukono, yaamweta ati: Mwishiki 'we, imuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Amagara ge gaamugarukamu, ahonaaho yaimuka; Yesu yaaragiira ngu bamuhe eky'okurya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Abazaire be baatangaara munonga; kwonka yaabeehanangiriza kutagira u baagambira ebyabaho.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutuma bari ikumi na babiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1-6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:1">Mat 10:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:14">9:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mak 6:7-13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu yaayeta hamwe bari ikumi na babiri, yaabaha amaani n'obushoboorozi ahari baadaimoni boona n'okutamba endwara. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Yaabatuma kugamba eby'obukama bwa Ruhanga n'okukiza abarwaire. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Yaabaragiira ati: Mutagira eki mwagyendana, n'obu yaakuba enkoni, nari enshaho, nari eby'okurya, nari empiiha; kandi mutatwara amakanzu abiri. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:5-11">Luk 10:5-11</ref>. </char></note> Enju yoona ei muraataahemu, mugume omwo, kandi nimwo muriruga. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Kandi ahu bataribaakiira hoona, ku muriba nimuruga omuri tauni egyo, mukunkumure omucuucu gw'omu bigyere byanyu okuba mushinja aharibo. <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Batyo baagyenda, baaraba omu birorero, nibabuurira engiri, nibatambira abantu hoonahoona.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7-9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1">Mat 14:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-16">Mak 6:14-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ow'eishaza Heroode ku yaahuriire ebyakozirwe byona, yaashoberwa munonga, ahakuba bamwe bakagira bati, Yohaana azookire omu bafu; <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />abandi ngu, Eliya areebekire; n'abandi ngu, omwe ahari baanabi aba ira azookire; <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:8">Luk 23:8</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Heroode we yaagira ati: Yohaana nkamutemaho omutwe. Kandi ogwo n'oha, ou ndikuhuriraho ebigambo ebyo? Yaayenda ngu amureebe.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuriisa abantu enkumi itaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10-17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mak 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Yoh 6:1-13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Entumwa ku zaagarukire, zaamugaaniirira ebi zaakozire byona. Yaazitwara, baayekiika omuri tauni erikwetwa Besesaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Emitwe y'abantu ku yaakimanyire, baamukurata; yaabaakiira n'okushemererwa, yaabagambira eby'obukama bwa Ruhanga, n'abaabaire nibenda kutambirwa yaabakiza. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Ku bwatandikire kwira, bari ikumi na babiri baija baamushaba nibagira bati: Raga abantu bagyende omu birorero n'omu byaro, baronde oburaaro n'eby'okurya; ahabw'okuba aha turi omu ihamba. <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Kwonka We yaabaragiira ati: Mube niimwe mwabaha eby'okurya. Baagira bati: Ebi twine n'emigaati etaano n'eby'enyanja bibiri kwonka, kureka tugyende tugure eby'okurya ahabw'aba bantu boona. <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Ahakuba bakaba bari abashaija nk'enkumi itaano. Yaaragiira abeegi be ati: Mubashutamye omu mitwe, nk'ey'ataano ataano. <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Baagira batyo, baabashutamya boona. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yaakwata egyo migaati etaano n'eby'enyanja bibiri, yaareeba ahaiguru, yaasiima, yaabicwamu, yaabiha abeegi be ngu babite omu maisho g'abantu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Boona baarya, baahaaga. Bwanyima baatorotoora oburagarika obwatsigaireho, bwaba ebitenga ikumi na bibiri.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okuhamya ku Yesu ari Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:18-27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:13-28">Mat 16:13-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-9:1">Mak 8:27—9:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabaire ayekiikire n'abeegi be naashaba, yaababuuza ati: Beitu abantu bagira ngu mba oha? <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Baamugarukamu bati: Yohaana Omubatizi; abandi ngu, Eliya; kandi abandi ngu Omwe ahari baanabi aba ira azookire. <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:69">Yoh 6:69</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaababuuza ati: Mbwenu shi imwe, mugira ngu mba oha? Petero yaagarukamu ati: Ori Kristo owa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yaabeehanangiriza naabaragiira kutagira u baakigambira; <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />naagira ati: Omwana w'omuntu ashemereire kubonabonesibwa omuri bingi, n'okwangwa abakuru n'abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki, n'okwitwa, kandi n'okuzooka aha kiro kya kashatu.<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omuhanda gw'omusharaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Kandi yaagambira boona ati: Omuntu weena oraayende kunkuratira, ayeyangise, ayekorere omusharaba gwe obutoosha, ankuratire. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh 12:25</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omuntu weena orikwenda kukiza amagara ge aryagabuza; kandi orikubuza amagara ge ahabwangye, aryagakiza. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Mbwenu omuntu kiryamugasira ki okutunga ensi yoona, akahwerekyerera, nari akafeerwa amagara ge? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mat 10:33</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu omuntu weena orikwitwa enshoni ahabwangye n'ahabw'ebigambo byangye, n'Omwana w'omuntu nawe aryaitwa enshoni ahabwe, ku ariizira omu kitiinisa kye, n'omu kitiinisa kya Ishe n'ekya baamaraika abarikwera. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omuri aba abeemereire aha, hariho bamwe abarireeba obukama bwa Ruhanga, batakafiire.<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhindurwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:28-36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:1-9">Mat 17:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-9">Mak 9:2-9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haahingwireho ebiro nka munaana aherize kugamba ebigambo ebyo, yaagyenda na Petero na Yohaana na Yakobo, yaatemba aha rushozi kushaba. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Ku yaabaire naashaba, enshusha y'ahamaisho ge yaahindurwa, ebijwaro bye byayera nibimurinkana. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Kandi reeba abashaija babiri Musa na Eliya baagaaniira nawe; <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />baareebeka baine ekitiinisa, baagamba aha kufa kwe, oku ariija kuhikiiririza Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:16-18">2 Pet 1:16-18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Petero na bagyenzi be bakaba baine oturo nibahungira; ku baakangukireyo, baareeba ekitiinisa kye n'abo bashaija babiri beemereire nawe. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Abashaija abo ku baabaire nibataana nawe, Petero yaagambira Yesu ati: Mwegyesa, ni kirungi obu turi aha; twombekye obuju bushatu, akamwe kabe akaawe, akandi kabe aka Musa, n'akandi aka Eliya; ahakuba akaba atarikumanya ki arikugamba. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Ku yaabaire naakigamba, ekicu kyaija, kyabasangira; ku baataahire omu kicu, baatiina. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Eiraka ryayema omu kicu, nirigira riti: Ogu n'Omwana wangye ou ntooraine; mumuhurire! <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Eiraka eryo ku ryaherize kugamba, baashanga Yesu ari wenka. N'ahabw'ekyo omu biro ebyo bakahunama, tibaagambiraho muntu weena kigambo na kimwe ahari ebyo ebi baareebire.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza omwana orikugwa entsimbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:37-45: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:14-23">Mat 17:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-32">Mak 9:14-32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku bwaseesire, baraire barugire aha rushozi, omutwe muhango gw'abantu gwamubugana. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Reeba omushaija ow'omu mutwe ogwo yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Mwegyesa, ninkweshengyereza, ndeebera omwana wangye w'omwojo; ahakuba niwe naazaire wenka. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Daimoni ku amukwata, ahonaaho ayamuza; amutetemya, areeta eifuro; amuhendagura, amurugaho yaamunogize. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Kandi naayeshengyereza abeegi baawe kumubinga, tibaabaasa. <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu yaagambira abeegi be ati: Ab'obusingye obutarikwikiriza, abarikwehabagiza, ndyaherera hi okuguma naimwe, n'okubagumisiririza? Ndeetera mutabani waawe. <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Omwana ku yaabaire nakiija, daimoni yaamuteera ahansi, yaamutaagura munonga. Yesu yaagambira kubi daimoni, yaatambira omwana, yaamugarurira ishe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Boona baatangaarira ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Kandi boona ku baabaire nibakitangaarira ebi yaakora byona, yaagira abeegi be ati: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />Ebigambo ebi mubihurire gye n'amatu gaanyu; ahakuba Omwana w'omuntu naija kuheebwayo omu mikono y'abantu. <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Kwonka tibarashoborokyeirwe ki yaabagambiire, kikaba kibakingiirwe, ngu batakyetegyereza; kandi batiina kukimubuuza.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:46-50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-40">Mak 9:33-40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima haabaho empaka omuribo ngu n'oha oraabe mukuru? <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu ku yaamanyire ebiteekateeko by'omu mitima yaabo, yaakwata omwana muto, yaamwemereza aha rubaju rwe, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />yaabagira ati: Weena orikwakiira omwana ogu omuto omu iziina ryangye, biri niinye ayakiire; kandi weena orikuunyakiira, biri ayakiire Owantumire; ahakuba omuto omuriimwe mwena, ogwo niwe mukuru.<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohaana yaagarukamu naagira ati: Mwegyesa, tureebire omuntu naabinga baadaimoni omu iziina ryawe, twamuzibira, ahabw'okutakwatanisa naitwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:23">Luk 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 1:18">Fil 1:18</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Yesu yaamugira ati: Mutamuzibira, ahakuba otari muzigu waanyu, aba ari owaanyu.<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abasamaria okushenda Yesu n'abeegi be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ebiro bye eby'okutemba omu iguru ku byabaire nibyenda kuhika, amaisho ge yaagateera kimwe aha kuza Yerusaalemu. Yaatuma entumwa kumwebembera; <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />zaagyenda, zaataaha omu kirorero ky'Abasamaria, kumuteguurira oburaaro. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:4">Yoh 4:4</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 4:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abantu baayanga kumwakiira, ahabw'okuba akaba agyemire ogurikuza Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:10">2 Bag 1:10</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 1:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Abeegi be Yakobo na Yohaana ku baakireebire, baamubuuza bati: Mukama waitu, nooyenda turagiire omuriro gurugye omu iguru, gushuume, gubacwekyereze? <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />We yaahinduka, yaabahana, ati: Timurikumanya mutima ogu mwine oku guri; <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />ahabw'okuba Omwana w'omuntu taraizire kucwekyereza amagara g'abantu, kureka okubajuna. Baagumizamu, baataaha omu kirorero ekindi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okukuratira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:57-60: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8:19-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibagyenda omu muhanda, omushaija yaamugira ati: Niinyija kukukuratira, ahu oraaze hoona. <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu yaamugambira ati: Zaamuha ziine ebiina, n'enyonyi z'omu mwanya ziine ebyashuri; kwonka Omwana w'omuntu taine na h'okuta omutwe. <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yaagambira ondiijo ati: Nkuratira! We yaagira ati: Mukama wangye, reka mbanze ngyende, nziikye tata. <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Reka abafu baziikye abafu baabo; kwonka iwe, ogyende obuzye hoona obukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Bag 19:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ondiijo yaagira ati: Ndyakukuratira, Mukama wangye; kwonka reka mbanze ndagye ab'omu ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Tihariho muntu ovuga ekyoma ekirikuhinga, akareeba enyima, oshemereire obukama bwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutuma entumwa makumi mushanju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:7-16">Mat 10:7-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo Mukama waitu yaatoorana abandi makumi mushanju, yaabatuma babiri babiri, ngu bamwebembere bagyende omuri tauni zoona n'omu myanya yoona ei yaabaire naayenda kuhikamu. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:35">Yoh 4:35</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:37">Mat 9:37</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 9:38">38</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Eby'okugyesha ni bingi, kwonka abagyesi ni bakye; n'ahabw'ekyo mushabe Mukama w'eigyesha atume abagyesi omu kugyesha kwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Mugyende; reeba, nimbatuma muri nk'entaama ahagati y'emishega. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mutatwara enshaho z'empiiha, n'obu zaakuba efurebe, nari enkaito; kandi mutagira ou mwaramutsya omu muhanda. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Enju yoona ei muraataahemu, mubanze mugire muti: Obusingye bugume omu nju egi! <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ku muraashangyemu omwana w'obusingye, obusingye bwanyu nibwija kuguma ahariwe; kwonka ku kiraabe kitari kityo, obusingye bwanyu nibwija kubagarukira. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:5-14">1 Kor 9:5-14</ref>. </char></note> Mugume omu nju egyo, murye kandi munywe ebi baraabagaburire; ahakuba omukozi ashemereire ebihembo bye; mutariruga omu nju mukagyenda nimuraararaara omu zindi. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:27">1 Kor 10:27</ref>. </char></note> Kandi tauni yoona ei muraataahemu, bakabaakiira, murye ebi baraabate omu maisho. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Mukize abarwaire baamwo, mubagambire muti: Obukama bwa Ruhanga bubairiire haihi. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Kwonka ku muraataahe omuri tauni yoona, bataabaakiira, mushohore omu nguuto zaayo, nimugira muti: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:6">Byak 18:6</ref>. </char></note> N'omucuucu ogw'omuri tauni yaanyu ogukwatsire omu bigyere byaitu, twagubakunkumurira; kwonka mumanye ngu obukama bwa Ruhanga bwahika haihi. <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nimbagambira nti: Aha kiro ekyo ekifubiro kya Sodoma kiryaba ekirikubaasa kwemerwa okukira ekya tauni egyo.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:21-23">Mat 11:21-23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Koraziini, oryakareeba! Naiwe Besesaida, oryakareeba! Ahabw'okuba eby'okutangaaza ebyakoreirwe omuriiwe, kuri noogira ngu bikakorerwa Tuuro na Sidoni, bakaabaire beeteisize kare, bashutami bajwaire ebiguniya, beeshukyeire eiju rya kashenda. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Mumanye ngu aha kiro ky'okucwa orubanja ekifubiro kya Tuuro na Sidoni kiryaba ekirikubaasa kwemerwa okukira ekyanyu. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Naiwe Kaperenaumu, nooyeraata ngu oryakuzibwa ohikye omu iguru? Ngaaha, oryagarurwa ahansi ohikye Okuzimu. <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:23">Yoh 5:23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:23">15:23</ref>. </char></note> Orikuhurira imwe, biri niinye ahuriire; kandi orikwanga imwe, biri niinye ayangire; kandi orikuunyanga, biri ayangire Ogwo owantumire.<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okugaruka kw'entumwa makumi mushanju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Abo beegi be makumi mushaju baagaruka n'okushemererwa, nibagira bati: Mukama waitu, na baadaimoni nibatworobera omu iziina ryawe. <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Yoh 12:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:8">Kush 12:8</ref>, <ref loc="REV 12:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Ndeebire Sitaane naagwa nk'omurabyo okuruga omu iguru. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:18">Mak 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:13">Zab 91:13</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, naabaha obushoboorozi bw'okuribata enjoka na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">N'akakooko akarikutoneza omukira. </char></note>skorupio n'amaani goona ag'omuzigu; kandi tihariho kintu ekiribakora kubi. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">Kur 32:32</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:5">Kush 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka eki mutakishemerererwa baadaimoni okuboorobera; kureka mushemererwe ahabw'amaziina gaanyu kuhandiikwa omu iguru. <verse eid="LUK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21-22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>. </char></note> Omu shaaha egyo yaashemerererwa omu Mwoyo Orikwera, naagira ati: Ninkusiima, Taata, Mukama w'eiguru n'ensi, ahabw'okuba ebyo okabishereka abanyabwengye n'abarikwetegyereza, waabishuuruurira abaana bato. Eego, Taata, ahakuba ekyo nikyo waasiimire. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Ebintu byona nkabiheebwa Tata; kandi tihariho orikumanya Omwana oku ari kureka Ishe, n'obu yaakuba orikumanya Ishe oku ari kureka Omwana, n'omuntu weena ou Omwana aikiriza kumumushuuruurira. <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:16">Mat 13:16</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Yaahindukira abeegi be, yaabagambira omu mubonano ati: Amaisho agarikureeba ebi murikureeba gaine omugisha. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Nimbagambira nti: Baanabi n'abagabe baingi bakeetenga kureeba ebi murikureeba, tibaabireeba, kandi n'okuhurira ebi murikuhurira, tibaabihurira.<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'Omusamaria omunyambabazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:25-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mat 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mak 12:28-34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwegyesa w'Ebiragiro yaayemerera, yaamutega naagira ati: Mwegyesa, nkore ki okuhungura amagara agatahwaho? <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: N'enki ekihandiikirwe omu Biragiro? Oshoma ota? <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Bir 6:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaagarukamu ati: Kunda Mukama Ruhanga waawe n'omutima gwawe gwona, n'amagara gaawe goona, n'amaani gaawe goona, n'obwengye bwawe bwona; kandi na mutaahi waawe nk'oku oyekunda. <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Waagarukamu gye; kora otyo, noija kugira amagara. <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Kwonka ahabw'okwenda kweyoreka nk'ohikiriire, yaabuuza Yesu ati: Mutaahi wangye n'oha?<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Omushaija akaba naaruga Yerusaalemu naashuma Yeriko; yaagwa omu bambuzi; baamujuura ebijwaro, baamuteera, baatsiga naayenda kufa. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Kandi omunyamurwa omwe akaba naashuuma omu muhanda ogwo, yaamugwaho atakimanyire; ku yaamureebire, yaamwetantara, yaaraba aha rundi rubaju, yaagumizamu. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />N'Omuleevi atyo, ku yaahikire aha mwanya ogwo, yaamureeba, yaaraba aha rundi rubaju. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Kwonka Omusamaria, owaabaire ari omu rugyendo rwe, ku yaizire, yaahika ahu yaabaire ari; ku yaamureebire, yaamugirira esaasi, <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />yaamuhikaho, yaashuka amajuta na viinyo omu buhuta bwe, yaamushemba; bwanyima yaamutembya aha ndogoya ye, yaamuhitsya omu nju y'abagyenzi, yaamurwaza. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Omu kasheeshe yaihayo edenaari ibiri, yaaziha mukama w'egyo nju, naagira ati: Omurwaze; ezi oraakorese okurenga aha zi nkutsigiire, ku ndigaruka, ndyazikwihura. <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Nooteekateeka, n'oha ahari abo abashatu owaabaire mutaahi w'ogwo owaagwire omu bambuzi? <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Yaagira ati: N'ogwo owaamugiriire esaasi. Yesu yaamugira ati: Gyenda, naiwe okore otyo.<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Mariza na Mariamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Yoh 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:2">12:2</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 12:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baagumizamu omuhanda gwabo. Yaataaha omu kirorero; omukazi orikwetwa Mariza yaamutaasya omu nju ye. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Kandi akaba aine omurumuna orikwetwa Mariamu; we yaashutama aha bigyere bya Mukama waitu, naahurira ebigambo bye. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Kwonka Mariza akaba ayemereize omutima ahabw'emirimo mingi y'okuheereza; yaija ahari Yesu, yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, tikirikukusaasa, murumuna wangye okumpenza emirimo? Mugambire ampwere. <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Mukama waitu yaamugarukamu ati: Mariza, Mariza, oyemereize omutima, noofa kubi n'ebintu bingi; <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:33">Mat 6:33</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ekirikwetengwa ni kimwe kyonka. Mariamu we atooraine omugabo murungi ogutarimwakwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okwegyesa eby'okushaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Yesu akaba ari omu mwanya gumwe naashaba; ku yaaherize, omwe aha beegi be yaamugira ati: Mukama waitu, twegyese okushaba, nk'oku Yohaana yaayegyeise abeegi be. <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6:9-13</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagarukamu ati: Ku muraabe nimushaba, mugire muti: Tataitwe, eiziina ryawe ryezibwe; obukama bwawe bwije; <verse eid="LUK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />ogume otuhe eby'okurya byaitu ebya buri izooba; <verse eid="LUK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />otusaasire eby'okushiisha byaitu, ahakuba naitwe tusaasira omuntu weena oine eibanja ryaitu; kandi otatutwara omu kwohibwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yaabagambira ati: N'oha omuriimwe oine munywani we, owaakuza owe omu itumbi, akamugira ati: Munywani wangye, nguza emigaati eshatu; <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />ahabw'okuba munywani wangye ondiijo yaija naaruga omu rugyendo, tiinyine ky'okumugaburira; <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />we akeema omu nju, akamugira ati: Reka kundusya! Naakingire, kandi nyowe n'abaana bangye twabyamire; tindikubaasa kwimuka kugira eki naakuha. <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Nimbagambira nti: N'obu yaakuba ataimukire kugimuheereza ahabw'okuba munywani we; kwonka ahabw'okugumizamu naamurusya, naija kwimuka amuhe ebi arikwenda byona. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">Mat 7:7-11</ref>. </char></note> Naanye nimbagambira nti: Mushabe, muryaheebwa; musherure, muryazoora; mwiguze, muryaigurirwaho; <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />ahakuba omuntu weena oshaba aheebwa, osherura azoora, kandi oiguza aigurirwaho. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ni muzaire ki omuriimwe, ou omwana we yaakushaba omugaati, akamuha eibaare; nari eky'enyanja, akamuha enjoka omu mwanya gwakyo? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Nari shi, ku yaakumushaba eihuri, akaamuha skorupio? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Imwe ku muraabe nimumanya kuha abaana baanyu ebiconco ebirungi, haza muri babi, mbwenu Shoimwe w'omu iguru tarikizaho kuha Omwoyo Orikwera abo abamushaba?<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okujuma Omwoyo Orikwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:14-26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">43-45</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mak 3:22-27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi akaba naabinga aha muntu daimoni ozibira abantu kugamba; daimoni ku yaamurugireho, omushaija ogwo, owaabaire ari ekiteta, yaagamba; abantu baatangaara. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Kwonka abandi baagira bati: Omushaija ogu baadaimoni naababingisa Belezebuli mukama waabo. <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mak 8:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abandi baamutega nibamushaba akamanyiso akarikuruga omu iguru. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yesu, ku yaamanyire ebiteekateeko byabo, yaabagira ati: Obugabe bwona ku bwebaganisamu, buhwerekyerezibwa; n'enju ku eyebaganisamu, egwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Mbwenu Sitaane, ku araabe naayebaganisamu wenka, obukama bwe buryagumaho buta? Ahabw'okuba mugira ngu, baadaimoni mbabingisa Belezebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Mbwenu nyowe baadaimoni ku ndaabe mbabingisa Belezebuli, abaana baanyu bo bababingisa oha? N'ahabw'ekyo abo nibo baribasingisa orubanja. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Kwonka ku ndaabe mbingisa baadaimoni orukumu rwa Ruhanga, mumanye ngu obukama bwa Ruhanga bubahikireho.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Omuntu ow'amaani oine eby'okurwanisa bye, ku arinda eka ye, ebintu bye biguma omu busingye. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:15">Kol 2:15</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka orikumukiza amaani, ku amuteera yaamubinga, amwaka eby'okurwanisa bye byona ebi yaabaire naayesiga, n'ebintu bye biri abinyaga, n'eminyago egyo agigaba. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Ou tutakwatanisa, n'omuzigu wangye; kandi otataaruura hamwe naanye, ataataanisa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Daimoni, ku aruga omu muntu, araba omu mpita ezitarimu maizi, naasherura oburuhuukiro; ku bumuburira, agira ati: Ka ngarukye omu nju yangye omu naarugire. <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Daimoni ku agaruka, ashanga eyeyereire, eboneziibwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:14">Yoh 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Atyo agyenda areeta baadaimoni abandi mushanju abarikumukira kuba babi; bataaha omwo, bagumamu. Ebya bwanyima by'omuntu ogwo bikira eby'okubanza kuba bibi.<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Ku yaabaire naagamba ebyo, omukazi owaabaire ari omu bateeraniire aho yaagamba n'eiraka rihango, naamugira ati: Enda eyaakuzaire n'amabeere agu waayonkire biine omugisha! <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Okukira, abaine omugisha, n'abahurira ekigambo kya Ruhanga, bakakyorobera.<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29-32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emitwe y'abantu ku yaayeyongyeire, yaatandika kugamba ati: Ab'obusingye obu n'ab'obusingye obubi; nibenda akamanyiso, kwonka tibarikaheebwa, kureka akamanyiso ka Yona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:22">1 Kor 1:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Nk'oku Yona yaabaire akamanyiso aha ba Nineeve, nikwo n'Omwana w'omuntu ariba aha b'obusingye obu. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1">1 Bag 10:1</ref>. </char></note> Omugabekazi w'eihanga ry'obukiizi-bwa-buryo aryayemerera n'ab'obusingye obu aha kiro ky'orubanja, arubasingise; ahabw'okuba akaruga aha muheru gw'ensi, yaija kuhurira obwengye bwa Sulemaani; kandi reeba, orikukira Sulemaani ari aha. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Yon 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Aba Nineeve baryayemerera n'ab'obusingye obu aha kiro ky'orubanja, barubasingise; ahabw'okuba bakeeteisa kandi reeba, orikukira Yona ari aha.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'etabaaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihariho muntu okongyeza etabaaza, akagita omu kiina nari omu kiibo, kureka aha kikondo kyayo, ngu abarikutaaha omu nju bareebe okwaka kwayo. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34-36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:22">Mat 6:22</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 6:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Etabaaza y'omubiri gwawe n'eriisho ryawe; eriisho ryawe ku riraabe riri gye, omubiri gwawe gwona guryaijura omushana; kwonka ku riraabe riri ribi, omubiri gwawe gwona guryaijura omwirima. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />N'ahabw'ekyo oyerinde, omushana oguri omuriiwe gutaba omwirima. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ahakuba omubiri gwawe gwona ku gurikuba gwijwire omushana, gutaine kacweka na kamwe ak'omwirima, guryabeera kimwe omushana, nk'oku etabaaza ekumurikira n'okwaka kwayo.<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuhana Abafarisaayo n'abeegyesa b'Ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:36">Luk 7:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:1">14:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabaire naakigamba, Omufarisaayo yaamweta kurya nawe; yaataahamu, yaashutama aha by'okurya. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:2">Mat 15:2</ref>. </char></note> Omufarisaayo yaatangaara okureeba yaarya atabandize kunaaba. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:39-52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>. </char></note> Mukama waitu yaamugira ati: Imwe Abafarisaayo mwozya aharuguru y'enkyeka n'orwabya, kwonka omunda zaanyu mwijwire obunyagi n'obubi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Imwe bashema 'mwe, Ogwo owaahangire eby'aharuguru, tiwe yaahangire n'eby'omunda? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />N'ahabw'ekyo ebiri omunda zaanyu mube nibyo mwagabira abooro n'embabazi, haza obwo byona bibone kubabeera ebishemeziibwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Imwe Bafarisaayo 'mwe, muryakareeba! Ahabw'okuba muganura kimwe kya ikumi ky'enshogi, n'eshwiga, n'emboga zoona, kwonka mwehuzya okucwa emanja z'oburyo n'okukunda Ruhanga; ebyo mukaashemereire kubikora, kandi na biri okutabireka. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 20:46">Luk 20:46</ref>. </char></note> Imwe Bafarisaayo 'mwe, muryakareeba! Ahabw'okuba mukunda emyanya ey'ekitiinisa omuri sinagogi n'okutangirirwa omu katare. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Muryakareeba, ahakuba nimushusha nk'ebituuro ebitarikureebwa, ebi abantu baribataho batamanyire.<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Omwe aha beegyesa b'Ebiragiro yaamugambira ati: Mwegyesa, ku orikugira otyo, naitwe nooba otujumire. <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu yaagira ati: Imwe abeegyesa b'Ebiragiro, naimwe muryakareeba! Ahabw'okuba mukorera abantu emitwaro etarikubaasa kwekorerwa, haza kunu mutarikugikoraho na rukumu rwanyu. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Muryakareeba! Ahabw'okuba mwombeka ebituuro bya baanabi, abu baashwenkuriimwe baitsire. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Mutyo muhamya ebi baashwenkuriimwe baakozire kandi mubisiima; ahakuba bo bakaita baanabi, kandi imwe mwombeka ebituuro byabo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />N'ahabw'ekyo Obwengye bwa Ruhanga bukagamba buti: Ndyabatumaho baanabi n'entumwa; abamwe aharibo baryabaita, abandi baryabahiiga, <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />eshagama ya baanabi boona eyaasheeshekire okuruga aha kuhangwa kw'ensi etukurire ab'obusingye obu, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Kut 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2 Bus 24:20</ref>. </char></note> okwiha aha shagama ya Abeeli okuhika aha shagama ya Zakaria, owaagwire ahagati y'eitambiro na hekalu. Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Eryatukurira ab'obusingye obu. <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Muryakareeba, imwe abeegyesa b'Ebiragiro! Ahabw'okuba mukaihaho ekishumuruzo ky'obwengye; imwe ahabwanyu timwataahamu, kandi n'abo abaabaire nibataahamu, mwabazibira.<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Ku yaarugireyo, abahandiiki n'Abafarisaayo baatandika kumumigisiriza n'amaani n'okumwegyenzaho, ngu bamugambise bingi, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 20:20">Luk 20:20</ref>. </char></note> nibamutega ngu bamwiheho ekigambo, bamuregye.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Okutatiina bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Omu biro ebyo, abantu enkumi n'enkumi bakateerana, baaribatiirirana; yaatandikira aha beegi be kubagambira ati: Mwerinde ekitumbisa ky'Abafarisaayo, nibwo buryarya. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26-33">Mat 10:26-33</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho kishwekirwe ekitarishuuruurwa, n'obu kyakuba ekisherekirwe ekitarimanywa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Eki mwagambiire omu mwirima kyona kiryahuririrwa omu mushana; n'eki mwagambiire omu kutu, muri omu kishengye, kiryagambirwa aha mutwe gw'enju.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Kandi nimbagambira, imwe banywani bangye, mutatiina abo abarikwita omubiri, bwanyima bataine kindi ki barikubaasa kukora. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Kwonka nimbahabura ou muraatiine; mutiine Ogwo, oine obushoboorozi bw'okunaga omuntu omuri Gehena yaaheza kumwita; eego, nimbagambira nti: Mutiine Ogwo. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Ebiteera-nkumba bitaano tibigurwa sente ibiri? Kwonka tihariho na kimwe aharibyo ekyeba omu maisho ga Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Nangwa n'eishokye ry'aha mitwe yaanyu ribazirwe ryona. Mutatiina; muri ab'obuguzi okukira ebiteera-nkumba bingi.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okujuma Omwoyo Orikwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Kandi nimbagambira nti: Omuntu weena orimpamya omu maisho g'abantu, Omwana w'omuntu nawe aryamuhamya omu maisho ga baamaraika ba Ruhanga; <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:26">Luk 9:26</ref>. </char></note> kwonka oriinyehakana omu maisho g'abantu, aryayehakanwa omu maisho ga baamaraika ba Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat 12:32</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena origamba kubi aha Mwana w'omuntu, aryasaasirwa, kwonka orirogota aha Mwoyo Orikwera tarisaasirwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:14">Luk 21:14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Ku baribatwara omu maisho g'abakuru ba sinagogi n'ag'abategyeki n'abaine obushoboorozi, mutaryemereza emitima oku murigarukamu, nari ebi muryetonganira, nari shi ebi murigamba; <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />ahakuba Omwoyo Orikwera aryabeegyesa omuri egyo shaaha eki mushemereire kugamba.<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omutungi omushema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Omuntu owaabaire ari omu mutwe ogwo yaamushaba ati: Mwegyesa, ragiira mwene tata tubagane obuhunguzi bwaitu. <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Iwe mushaija 'we, n'oha owantaireho kubacwera orubanja, nari shi okuba ow'okubabaganisiza? <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:9">1 Tim 6:9</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 6:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Muhurire, mwerinde okwetenga kwona, ahabw'okuba amagara g'omuntu tigari mu bwingi bw'ebintu ebi aine. <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yaabacwera enfumu ati: Hakaba hariho omutungi owaabaire aine emisiri eyezire munonga. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Yaayebuuza omu mutima gwe ati: Ngire nta; ahakuba tiinyine h'okuhunika emyaka yangye? <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Yaagira ati: Eki ndaakore n'eki; niinyija kusheenya ebitara byangye, nyombekye ebirikukira obuhango; omwo nimwo ndaahunikye emyaka yangye yoona, <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />obwo ndyagambira omutima gwangye nti: Mutima gwangye, oine ebintu bingi ebibiikirwe eby'okumara emyaka mingi; mbwenu huumura, orye, onywe, oshemererwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:27">Heb 9:27</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Ruhanga yaagira ati: Iwe mushema we! Eki kiro noija kwakwa amagara gaawe. Mbwenu ebi waayeteekateekyeire biryaba eby'oha? <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Nikwo omuntu ashusha atyo, oyebiikira obutungi, haza atari mutungi ahari Ruhanga.<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuteemereza mitima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:22-31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:25-33">Mat 6:25-33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaagambira abeegi be ati: Nikyo ndikubagirira nti: Mutaryemereza emitima ahabw'amagara gaanyu eki murirya, nari shi aha mibiri yaanyu eki murijwara. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ahakuba amagara nigakira eby'okurya, n'omubiri nigukira ebijwaro. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 147:9">Zab 147:9</ref>. </char></note> Muteekateekye aha bikoona; tibibiba, kandi tibigyesha, tibigira bubiiko nari ebitara, kwonka Ruhanga abigaburira. Imwe, timurikukira enyonyi? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />N'oha omuriimwe, orikubaasa kwongyera <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nari: aha rugyero rwe ekita na kimwe. </char></note>ekiro na kimwe aha rugyero rw'emyaka y'obukuru bwe ahabw'okwemereza omutima? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Mbwenu ku muraabe mutarikubaasa kukora ekintu kikye nk'ekyo, nimwemerereza ki emitima ahabw'ebindi? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Muteekateekye aha birabyo oku bimera; tibigira murimo, tibiruka myenda; kwonka nimbagambira nti: Nangwa na Sulemaani omu kitiinisa kye kyona taraizihiirwe nka kimwe aharibyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Mbwenu Ruhanga, ku araabe ajweka atyo obunyaatsi bw'omu ishwa, oburiho eri izooba, nyencakare bukanagwa omu mahega, taribajweka okubukira imwe abaine okwikiriza kukye? <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Mutarisherura eki muraarye nari eki muraanywe, kandi mutaryemereza emitima. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Nimumanya ngu ebyo byona amahanga goona ag'omu nsi nibyo gasherura; kandi Shoimwe naamanya ku mubikyenire. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Kureka musherure obukama bwa Ruhanga, n'ebyo nabyo muryabyongyerwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Mutatiina, imwe obusyo obukye, ahabw'okuba Shoimwe naasiima munonga kubaha obukama. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33-34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:20">Mat 6:20</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 6:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Mutunde ebi mwine, mugabe eby'embabazi, mwebaziirire enshaho z'empiiha ezitarikukura, eitungo ry'omu iguru eritahwaho, ahu omushuma atahika, n'obu haakuba ahu ekiyenje kitashiisha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:22">Luk 18:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ahakuba ahu eitungo ryanyu riri, n'omutima gwanyu niho guba.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okureeba n'okutegyereza Mukama waitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:35-46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:42-51">Mat 24:42-51</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mugume mwezirikire enkoba zaanyu, n'etabaaza zaanyu zigume nizaaka; <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mat 25:1-13</ref>. </char></note> naimwe mube nk'abantu abategyereize mukama waabo okugaruka omuka naaruga omu bugyenyi, ngu ku ariija yaayeranga, barahukye kumwiguriraho. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:4">Yoh 13:4</ref>. </char></note> Baine omugisha abahuuku abo, abu mukama waabo ariija akashanga bamutegyereize. Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Aryayezirika, abashutamye aha by'okurya, aije abaheereze. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Rugriika: ku ariija omu bunaku bw'abarinzi ba kabiri nari aba kashatu. </char></note>Ku ariija abantu bahirwayo, nari omu itumbi, yaashanga abahuuku abo bari batyo, baryaba baine omugisha. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:2">1 Tes 5:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka mumanye eki, ngu kuri nyineeka amanya obunaku omushuma obu araiziremu, akaagumire naareeba, taakurekire nju ye kurimwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Naimwe mugume mweteekateekire; ahabw'okuba omu shaaha ei muteeteekateekyeiremu Omwana w'omuntu niyo ariiziramu. <verse eid="LUK 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petero yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, enfumu egi ei waacwa, niitwe waagicwera, nari waagicwera n'abandi boona? <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:15">2 Tim 2:15</ref>. </char></note> Mukama waitu yaagira ati: Omubiiki orikwesigwa kandi ow'obwengye n'oha, ou mukama we aritsigira ab'omu ka ye, okubagaburira omugabo gwabo omu bunaku obushemereire? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Aine omugisha, omugaragwa ogwo, ou mukama we ariija, akashanga naakora atyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Aryamukwatsa ebi atungire byona. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Kwonka omugaragwa ogwo, ku arigira omu mutima gwe ati: Mukama wangye atwireyo, yaatandika kuteera abahuuku n'abazaana, kandi n'okurya n'okunywa n'okusinda; <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />mukama w'omugaragwa ogwo aryaija aha kiro eki atarikumuteekateekyeraho, n'omu shaaha ei atarikumanya, aryamwasha, amuhe omugabo gwe hamwe n'abatarikwesigwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:17">Yak 4:17</ref>. </char></note> Omugaragwa ogwo, owaamanyire ebi mukama we akunda, aryateerwa nyingi; <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />kwonka otarabimanyire, akakora ebishemereire kumuteeza, aryateerwa nkye. Omuntu weena orikuheebwa bingi, aryabuuzibwa bingi; n'ogwo orikwatsibwa bingi, niwe barikira kwenza bingi.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Nkaija kunaga omuriro aha nsi, kandi ku guraabe gwakwatsire, ekindi niinyenda ki? <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:22">Mat 20:22</ref>. </char></note> Hariho okubatizibwa oku nshemereire kubatizibwamu; yeimwe, ka ninshaasha okuhitsya obu kurihikiirizibwa! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:51-53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>. </char></note> Nimuteekateeka ngu nkaija kureeta obusingye omu nsi? Nimbagambira nti: Tikwo kiri; kureka okutaanisa. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Okuruga hati omu nju emwe haryabamu bataano bataanukaine, abashatu n'ababiri, n'ababiri n'abashatu batakwataniise. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7:6</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo baritaanuukana; omushaija tarikwatanisa na mutabani, omutabani na ishe; omukazi tarikwatanisa na muhara we, omuhara na nyina; nyinazaara tarikwatanisa na mukaamwana we, omukaamwana na nyinazaara.<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:54: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:2">Mat 16:2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 16:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaagambira n'emitwe y'abantu ati: Ku mureeba ekicu nikiruga oburengyerwa-izooba, ahonaaho mugira ngu enjura yaaza kugwa; kandi nikwo kiba. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Ku mureeba omuyaga nigwiha omu bukiizi-bwa-buryo, mugira ngu nihaija kujwa omushana mwingi; kandi nikwo kiba. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Imwe ndyarya 'mwe, mumanya kukyenga enshusha y'ensi n'eiguru; beitu ahabw'enki mutamanya kukyenga obunaku obu? <verse eid="LUK 12:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Kandi ahanki imwe ahabwanyu mutamanya ekihikire?<verse eid="LUK 12:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:58: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:25">Mat 5:25</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 5:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oraabe nookigyenda n'orikukutabaariza aha muramuzi, oteereho kwikirizana nawe mukiri omu muhanda, arekye kukukurura, akakutwara aha muramuzi, n'omuramuzi akakuha omuserukare, n'omuserukare akakuta omu kihome. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ninkugambira nti: Torirugamu okuhitsya obu oriihura eibanja ryona, otatsigyeyo nangwa na sente emwe.<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abagalilaaya okwitwa Pilaato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:37">Byak 5:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo hakaba hariho abantu bamwe abaabaire bari aho, baamuteekyerereza eby'Abanyagalilaaya, abu Pilaato yaajwangize eshagama yaabo n'ebitambo byabo. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Nimugira ngu Abanyagalilaaya abo bakaba bari abasiisi okukira abandi Banyagalilaaya boona, nikyo baitiirwe kubi batyo? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Nimbagambira nti: Tikwo kiri; mumanye ngu naimwe, ku muraabe muteeteisize, muryahwerekyerera mwena nkabo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Nari shi, abantu abo ikumi na munaana, abu omunaara gw'omuri Siloamu gwagwereire, gukabaita, nimugira ngu bakaba bari abasiisi okukira abandi boona abaabaire batuura Yerusaalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Nimbagambira nti: Tikwo kiri; mumanye ngu naimwe ku muraabe muteeteisize, muryahwerekyerera mwena nkabo.<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'omutiini ogwabaire gutarikwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Luk 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:13">Mak 11:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi akabacwera enfumu egi ati: Hakaba hariho omushaija owaabyaire omutiini omu musiri gwe gw'emizaabibu; yaija kugusheruraho ebyana, byamuburira. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Yaagira omuhingi w'emizaabibu ati: Reeba, mmazire emyaka egi eshatu niinyija kusherura ebyana aha mutiini ogu, nibimburira. Guteme; nigwitira ki omwanya? <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:9">2 Pet 3:9</ref>, <ref loc="2PE 3:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Omuhingi yaamugarukamu naagira ati: Mukama wangye, gurekye n'omwaka ogu, mbanze nguhingirire, ngutemu amasha. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Bwanyima ku guryana, kiryaba gye; ku guriba gutaanire, oryagutema.<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omukazi oremaire omugongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Ku yaabaire naayegyesa omuri sinagogi emwe aha izooba rya Sabato; <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />hakaba harimu omukazi omazire emyaka ikumi na munaana ariho daimoni orikumuzya; akaba ainami, atarikubaasa kwinamuka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu ku yaamureebire, yaamweta, yaamugira ati: Mukazi 'we, waabohoororwa omu bumuga bwawe.<verse eid="LUK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yaamutaho engaro; ahonaaho yaagororoka, yaahimbisa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Kwonka omukuru wa sinagogi yaagira ekiniga ahabw'okuba Yesu yaatamba ahari Sabato, yaagambira abantu ati: Hariho ebiro mukaaga, ebishemereire kukorerwamu emirimo; n'ahabw'ekyo mube nibyo mwaguma nimwiziramu kutambirwa, kwonka ti hari Sabato. <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:5">Luk 14:5</ref>. </char></note> Mukama waitu yaamugarukamu ati: Imwe ndyarya 'mwe, omuriimwe mwena hariho otatsibura nte ye nari endogoya ye ahari Sabato, akagitwara kugyeshera? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />N'omukazi ogu, muhara wa Abrahamu, ou Sitaane yaabohire emyaka ikumi na munaana, tashemereire kubohororwa omu bumuga obu aha izooba rya Sabato? <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Ku yaagambire ebyo, abazigu be boona baakwatwa enshoni; abantu boona baashemerererwa eby'ekitiinisa byona ebi yaakozire.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu ezindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:18-21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Mat 13:31-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mak 4:30-32</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo yaagira ati: Obukama bwa Ruhanga nibushusha ki? Kandi nimbugyeranisa na ki? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Nibushusha nk'akajuma ka sinaapi, aku omuntu yaatwaire, akakabiba omu musiri gwe; bwanyima kakakura, kakaba omuti; enyonyi z'omu mwanya zikaarika omu mataagi gaagwo.<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Obukama bwa Ruhanga mbugyeranise na ki! <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Nibushusha nk'ekitumbisa eki omukazi yaatwaire, akakishereka omu ncuro z'esaano ishatu, okuhitsya obu zoona zaatumbisiibwe.<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eirembo erifunzire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yaagumizamu yaaraba omuri tauni n'ebirorero, naayegyesa, ari omu muhanda naaza Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Omwe yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, biri abarikujunwa ni bakye? Yesu yaabagira ati: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:13">Mat 7:13</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:12">1 Tim 6:12</ref>. </char></note> Mwezirikye kutaahira omu irembo erifunzire; ahakuba nimbagambira nti: Baingi baryayetenga kutaahamu, tibaribaasa. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:11">Mat 25:11</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 25:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Nyineeka ku ariheza kwimuka n'okukinga orwigi, muryatandika kwemerera aheeru kukongoota aha rwigi nimwiguza, nimugira muti: Mukama waitu, twigurireho. Nawe aryabagarukamu ati: Tindikumanya i murikuruga. <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Naimwe muryatandika kugira muti: Tukaba turiira kandi tunywera omu maisho gaawe, kandi naiwe okaba oyegyesa omu mihanda y'owaitu. <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Kwonka aryabagarukamu ati: Nimbagambira nti: Tindikumanya i murikuruga; mundugye omu maisho, imwe enkozi z'ebibi. <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28-29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11">Mat 8:11</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 8:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Aho niho muriririra mukanena enshaya, ku murireeba Abrahamu na Isaaka na Yakobo na baanabi boona bari omu bukama bwa Ruhanga, haza imwe mubingiirwe aheeru. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:11">Mal 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:3">Zab 107:3</ref>. </char></note> Baryaruga oburugwa-izooba n'oburengyerwa-izooba, n'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho n'obwa-buryo, bashutame omu bukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Kandi reeba, hariho ab'enyima abariba ab'okubanza, n'ab'okubanza abariba ab'enyima.<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okugamba ahari Heroode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Omu shaaha egyo bamwe aha Bafarisaayo baija baamugira bati: Ruga aha, ogyende; ahabw'okuba Heroode naayenda kukwita. <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yaabagira ati: Mugyende mugambire muha egyo, muti: Reeba, naabinga baadaimoni, naakiza endwara eri izooba na nyencakare; aha kiro kya kashatu naija kuhereza kimwe eki yaiziriire. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Kwonka nshemereire kugumizamu eri izooba na nyencakare na bwasheesha; ahakuba tikirikubaasika nabi kuhwerekyererera ahandi, kureka Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:34-35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Yerusaalemu, Yerusaalemu, oita baanabi, kandi oteera amabaare abakutumwaho! Ka ni kaingi obu naayenzire kubumbatira abaana baawe, nk'oku enkoko ebumbatira abaana baayo omunda y'amapapa gaayo, haza mutankundire! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Yer 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:26">Zab 118:26</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, enju yaanyu ebatsigiirwe eri omushaka; kandi nimbagambira nti: Timurindeeba okuhitsya obu murigira muti: Orikwija omu iziina rya Mukama asiimwe.<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza orwaire orusimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:37">11:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha izooba rya Sabato yaataaha omu nju y'omwe aha bakuru b'Abafarisaayo kurya; baamutaho amaisho. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Kandi omu maisho ge hakaba hariho omushaija orwaire orusimba. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu yaabuuza abeegyesa b'Ebiragiro n'Abafarisaayo ati: Ebiragiro nibiikiriza okukiza ahari Sabato nari shi tikwo? <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Baahunama. Yesu yaamukwata, yaamukiza, yaamwohereza. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mat 12:11</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: N'oha omuriimwe, ku arikuba aine endogoya nari ente yaagwa omu iziba, otarikugiihamu ahonaaho aha izooba rya Sabato? <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Baabura eky'okumugarukamu ahari ekyo.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuteetunguura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:6">Mat 23:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaacwera enfumu abo abeetsirwe aha by'okurya, ku yaareebire oku barikweha emyanya y'ekitiinisa, yaabagira ati: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6">Enf 25:6</ref>. </char></note> omuntu, ku arikweta aha bugyenyi bw'okushwera, otarishutama omu mwanya gw'ekitiinisa, hatakaija ondiijo, orikukukiza ekitiinisa, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />obeetsire mwembi akaija, akakugira ati: Heereza ogu omwanya, okatandika kugaruka omu mwanya gw'enyima y'endiijo yoona noobwerabwera. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Kwonka ku oryetwa aha bugyenyi, ogyende oshutame omu mwanya gw'enyima y'endiijo yoona, okwetsire ku araije, akugira ati: Munywani wangye, irira omu maisho; obwo oryagira ekitiinisa omu maisho gaabo boona abu oshutami nabo aha by'okurya. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ahakuba weena orikwetunguura aryagarurwa ahansi; kandi orikwegarura ahansi, aryatunguurwa.<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Kandi yaagambira n'ogwo omwetsire ati: ku oriba waateekyeire abantu eby'okurya nyomushana nari nyekiro, otaryeta banywani baawe, nari beene sho, nari beene waanyu, n'obu baakuba bataahi baawe abatungi, nabo obundi batakaakweta nk'oku waabeetsire, bakakwihura. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Kwonka, ku oriba waateekire eby'okurya, oyete abooro, ebimuga, ebirema, n'empumi; <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:29">Yoh 5:29</ref>. </char></note> kandi oryaheebwa omugisha; ahabw'okuba bo tibaine ky'okukwihura; oryaihurwa aha kuzooka kw'abahikiriire.<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'abataahi b'obugyenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Omwe ahari abo abaabaire bashutami nawe aha by'okurya, ku yaahuriire ebyo, yaamugira ati: Oririira eby'okurya omu bukama bwa Ruhanga aine omugisha!<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:16-24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:2-10">Mat 22:2-10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu yaamugira ati: Omuntu akateeka obugyenyi, yaabwetaho baingi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Obunaku bw'okurya ku bwahikire, yaatuma omuhuuku kugambira abeetsirwe, ati: Mwije; ahakuba byona byatebeekanisiibwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Boona baatandika kwekwatsakwatsa nk'abaragaine. Ow'okubanza yaamugira ati: Nguzire ekibanja, nshemereire kugyenda nkireebe. Naakweshengyereza, ondereere. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Ondiijo yaagira ati: Nguzire enimi ikumi z'okuhingisa; ninza kuzigyeza; naakweshengyereza, ondereere. <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Ondiijo yaagira ati: Ntaahize omukazi, n'ahabw'ekyo tindikubaasa kwija. <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Omuhuuku yaagaruka, yaabitekyerereza mukama we. Nyineeka nikwo kukwatwa ekiniga, akagira omuhuuku we ati: Irooko oze omu nguuto n'omu mihanda omuri tauni, oreete abooro n'ebimuga n'empumi n'abarikucumbagira. <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Bwanyima omuhuuku yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, eki waaragiira kyakorwa; kwonka hakiriho omwanya. <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Mukama we yaagira omuhuuku we ati: Gyenda omu mihanda n'omu buhanda oburikuraba omu bikaari, ogyeme abantu baije, enju yangye eijure. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ahakuba nimbagambira nti: Tihariho n'omwe ahari abo abeetsirwe, oraatamire aha by'okurya ebi mbateekyeire.<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okukuratira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Emitwe y'abantu baingi yaamukuratira; Yesu yaabahindukira, yaabagira ati: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat 10:37</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:38">38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:29">Luk 18:29</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena, orikwija ahi ndi, atangire ishe na nyina, n'omukazi we, n'abaana be, na beene ishe, na banyaanya, kandi n'amagara ge, tarikubaasa kuba mwegi wangye. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk 9:23</ref>. </char></note> Weena oteekorera musharaba gwe, akankurata, tarikubaasa kuba mwegi wangye. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />N'oha omuriimwe, owaakuba naayenda kwombeka omunaara, atabanze kushutama akabariirira eby'emirimo yaagwo, akamanya ku araabe aine eby'okuguheza; <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />ku yaakuba atatwarize atyo, akiba yaaheza omusingi, akaremerwa aho, abarikukireeba boona bakaatandika kumushekyerera, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />nibagira bati: Omushaija ogu akatandika kwombeka, tiyaabaasa kuheza. <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Kandi ni mugabe ki, owaakuza kurwana n'ondi, atabanze kushutama, akeehanuuza ku araabe naabaasa kuhurura n'engabo ze kakumi, ngu abone kurwanisa ogwo oizire kumuteera n'engabo obukumi bubiri? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ku areeba atarikubaasa, atuma ahari oriya entumwa, akiri hare munonga amubuuza eki yaakumuhongyera, ngu bagire obusingye. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />N'ahabw'ekyo omuntu weena omuriimwe tarikubaasa kuba mwegi wangye, yaaba atatsigire bi aine byona.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mak 9:50</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwonyo ni murungi; kwonka ku guraabe guhweirwemu ensha, muryagigaruramu muta? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Niguba gutakishemererera musiri, n'obu rwakuba orubungo; bafa okugunaga. Oine amatu agarikuhurira, ahurire.<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'entaama eyaabuzire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Abahooza n'abasiisi bakaba nibamwirira haihi kumuhurira. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:30">Luk 5:30</ref>. </char></note> Abafarisaayo n'abahandiiki baayetomboita nibagira bati: omushaija ogu ayakiira abasiisi, kandi arya nabo. <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yesu nikwo kubacwera enfumu egi ati: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18:12-14</ref>. </char></note> Ni muntu ki omuriimwe, oine entaama igana, ku haakuburaho emwe, otakaatsigaho ziri makumi mwenda na mwenda omu ishwa, akakurata egyo ebuzire, okuhitsya ahu arigibonera?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:11">Ezk 34:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:16">16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Ku agibona, agiheeka aha mabega ge, ashemereirwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Ku ahika omuka, ayeta banywani be na bataahi be, naabagira ati: Mushemererwe naanye, ahabw'okuba mboine entaama yangye ebaire ebuzire. <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Nimbagambira nti: Nikwo n'omu iguru barishemerererwa batyo omusiisi omwe orikweteisa, okukira abahikiriire makumi mwenda na mwenda abatarikwetenga kweteisa.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Nari shi ni mukazi ki, oine empiiha z'efeeza ikumi, ku haakuburaho <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rupiiha omu Rugriika ni drachma. </char></note>rupiiha emwe, otakaakongyeza etabaaza, akeeyerera enju, akeezirika kusherura okuhitsya ahu arigibonera? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ku agibona, ayeta banywani be na bataahi be, naagira ati: Mushemererwe naanye, ahabw'okuba mboine rupiiha yangye ebaire ebuzire. <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Nimbagira nti: Nikwo hariho okushemererwa omu maisho ga baamaraika ba Ruhanga ahabw'omusiisi omwe orikweteisa.<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'omwana owaarazire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Kandi yaagira ati: Hakaba hariho omushaija owaabaire aine abatabani babiri. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Omuto yaashaba ishe ati: Taata, mpa omugabo gw'ebintu ebi waakundagire. Ishe yaababaganisiza eitungo rye. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 29:3">Enf 29:3</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima y'ebiro bikye, omwana ogwo omuto yaateerana hamwe ebintu bye byona, yaagyenda, yaaza omu nsi endiijo eya hare. Ku yaahikireyo, yaashiishagurira ebintu bye omu micwe mibi.<verse eid="LUK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Ku yaabiherizeho, haabaho enjara nyingi omu nsi egyo; yaaconcoboza. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ahabw'ekyo yaagyenda, yaashumba aha muntu ow'omu nsi egyo; omushaija ogwo yaamwohereza omu mariisizo ge kuriisa empunu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Yaayetenga kurya ebishushu ebi empunu zaabaire zirya, kandi tihariho waabaire amuha ekintu kyona. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Ku yaayegarukiremu, yaayebuuza ati: Abapakasi ni bangahi abarikukorera tata, abarya eby'okurya bakaremwa; haza nyowe enjara neenyitira aha! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:12">Yer 3:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 3:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:4">Zab 51:4</ref>. </char></note> Ka nyimukye, nze owa tata, mmugire nti: Taata, nkacumura aha W'omu iguru kandi n'omu maisho gaawe; <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />tinshemereire kwetwa omwana waawe; ongire nk'omwe aha bapakasi baawe abakorera ebihembo. <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Yaimuka kuza owa ishe. Ku yaabaire akiri hare munonga, ishe yaamureeba, yaakwatwa embabazi, yairuka, yaamugwa omunda, yaamunywegyera. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Omwana yaamugira ati: Taata, nkacumura aha W'omu iguru, kandi n'omu maisho gaawe, tinkiri w'okwetwa omwana waawe. <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Kwonka ishe yaaragiira abahuuku be ati: Mwehuute mureete ekijwaro ekirikukira oburungi, mukumujwekye, n'empeta omu rukumu, n'enkaito omu bigyere; <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />mureete enyana y'ebishaju, mugiite, turye, tushemererwe; <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1">Efe 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 2:5">5</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba omwana wangye ogu akaba afiire, hati yaazooka; akaba azaahire, mbwenu yaazaahuuka. Baatandika kushemererwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Obwo mukuru we akaba ari omu musiri; ku yaarugireyo, yairira haihi n'eka, yaahurira emikuri n'okuzina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Yaayeta omwe aha bahuuku, yaamubuuza ebyo oku biri. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />We yaamugarukamu ati: Murumuna waawe yaija; kandi sho yaamubaagira enyana y'ebishaju, ahabw'okumubona akihuriire. <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:2">Luk 15:2</ref>. </char></note> Onu yaaguubwa kubi, yaayanga kutaaha omuka. Ishe yaashohora, yaamweshengyereza; <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />omwojo ogwo yaagarukamu ishe ati: Reeba, mmazire emyaka mingi ninkuheereza, tinkagomeraga kiragiro kyawe kyona; kwonka tokampaga kabuzi, ngu naanye nshemererwe n'abanywani bangye. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Mbwenu omwana waawe ogu, owaamariire obutungi bwawe omuri baamaraaya, ku yaija, waamubaagira enyana y'ebishaju. <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Ishe yaamugira ati: Mwana wangye, otuura naanye ebiro byona, kandi ebyangye byona n'ebyawe. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Kwonka eky'okwesiima n'okushemererwa kyaba kihikire; ahabw'okuba murumuna waawe ogu akaba afiire, hati yaazooka; akaba azaahire, mbwenu yaazaahuuka.<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'omubiiki mubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu yaagaruka yaagira abeegi be ati: Hakaba hariho omuntu omutungi, owaabaire aine omubiiki; baamumuregaho ku arikushiisha ebintu bye. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Yaamweta, yaamubuuza ati: Eki, eki ndikukuhuriraho, n'enki? Nyoreka oku waatwarize eby'obubiiki bwawe; ahakuba tokishemerera kuba mubiiki wangye. <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Omubiiki yaayebuuza ati: Ngire nta, ahabw'okuba mukama wangye yaaza kumbinga omu bubiiki? Tiinyine maani g'okuhinga, kandi n'okushabiriza nikuunyitsa enshoni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Mbwenu naamanya eki ndaakore, kikantaasya omu maka g'abantu, ku ndaabingwe omu bubiiki. <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Yaayeta weena oine eibanja rya mukama we, yaabuuza ow'okubanza ati: Mukama wangye naakwihuza ki? <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Encuro z'amajuta igana. Omubiiki yaamugira ati: Kwata orupapura rwawe oru orikwihurizibwaho, orahukye kushutama, ohandiikyeho makumi ataano. <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Yaabuuza ondiijo ati: Iwe naakwihuza ki? Onu yaamugira ati: Ebitenga by'engano igana. Yaamugira ati: Kwata orupapura rwawe oru orikwihurizibwaho, ohandiikyeho makumi munaana. <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:8">Efe 5:8</ref>. </char></note> Mukama w'omubiiki otarikwesigwa yaamusiima ahabw'obwengye obu yaagizire; ahakuba abantu b'ensi egi omu busingye bwabo nibakiza abantu b'omushana obwengye. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:21">Mat 19:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nimbagambira nti: Mwenywanire na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mamona n'ekigambo ky'orurimi orurikwetwa Aramaici, amakuru ngu eitungo. </char></note>Mamona etari y'okuhikiirira, nyentsya ku erihwaho, babaakiire omu maka agatahwaho.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Oyesigwa omu bikye munonga, niwe ayesigwa n'omu bingi; kandi oteesigwa mu bikye munonga, niwe ateesigwa na mu bingi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ku muraabe mubaire mutari beesigwa mu butungi obutari bw'okuhikiirira, n'oha oribakwatsa obutungi bw'amazima? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Kandi ku muraabe mubaire mutari beesigwa mu by'abandi, n'oha oribaha ebyanyu eby'okwetegyekyera? <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho muhuuku orikubaasa kuheereza abakama babiri; ahakuba ku yaakukora atyo, akaayangaho omwe, akunda ondiijo; nari agumira ahari omwe, agaya ondiijo. Timurikubaasa kuheereza Ruhanga na Mamona.<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Abafarisaayo, abaabaire bari abakunzi b'empiiha, ku baahuriire ebyo byona, baamushekyerera. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:9-14">Luk 18:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 6:16">Enf 6:16</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 6:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Imwe muri abantu abeehindura abahikiriire omu maisho g'abantu, kwonka Ruhanga naamanya emitima yaanyu; mumanye ngu ekirikuhimbisibwa omu bantu n'ekirikunugwa omu maisho ga Ruhanga.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mat 11:12</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebiragiro na Baanabi bikaba biriho okuhitysa omu biro bya Yohaana; okuruga obwo enkuru nungi ey'obukama bwa Ruhanga ebuurirwa, kandi omuntu weena abutaahamu n'amaani. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Nikirahuka eiguru n'ensi okuhwaho okukira akatoonyezi kamwe k'omu Biragiro okuhwaho.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena orikushenda omukazi we akashwera ondiijo, naaba ashambaine; kandi orikushwera omukazi obingirwe iba, nawe naaba ashambaine.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'omutungi n'omworo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Hakaba hariho omutungi, owaabaire ajwara ebijwaro bya bujwa n'emyenda ya bafuta emirungi, kandi ebiro byona akaba asiiba ajarami, naarya gye. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Kandi hakaba hariho n'omworo, owaabaire naayetwa Laazaaro, ou baabaire babyamya aha irembo ry'omutungi ogwo, omubiri gwe gwijwire ebironda. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:27">Mat 15:27</ref>. </char></note> Akaba ayetenga kugaburirwa ebirikuragara ahansi y'emeeza y'ogwo mutungi; kandi n'embwa zikaba ziija, zirigatsa ebironda bye. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Bwanyima omworo ogwo yaafa, yaatwarwa baamaraika omu kifuba kya Abrahamu. Omutungi ogwo nawe yaafa, yaaziikwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Ku yaahikire okuzimu, yainamura amaisho ge naahururwa, yaareeba Abrahamu hare na Laazaaro ari omu kifuba kye. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Yaayeta munonga naagira ati: Taata Abrahamu, nsaasira, otume Laazaaro akoze enshonga y'orukumu rwe omu maizi, afukiirize orurimi rwangye; ahabw'okuba nimpururwa omu muriro ogu. <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Kwonka Abrahamu yaagira ati: Mwana wangye, ijuka oku waahairwe ebirungi byawe okiri omu nsi, na Laazaaro nikwo yaahairwe ebibi; mbwenu hati ari aha, ari gye, iwe noohururwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Kandi t'ekyo kyonka, ahagati yaitu naimwe hariho orusa ruhango orwataireho, ngu ruremese abarikwenda kuruga aha kuza ei muri, kandi ngu ruzibire omuntu weena kuruga okwo kwija ahu turi. <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Omutungi yaagira ati: Mbwenu ninkweshengyereza, Taata, omutume owa tata; <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />ahakuba nyineyo barumuna bangye bataano, abahabure, nabo barekye kwija omu mwanya ogu ogurimu okuhururwa munonga. <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:16">2 Tim 3:16</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaagira ati: Baine Musa na baanabi, babe nibo baahurira. <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Omutungi yaagira ati: Ngaaha, Taata Abrahamu; ku haraazeyo ozookire omu bafu, baryayeteisa. <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh 11:45-53</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugarukamu ati: Ku baraabe banga kuhurira Musa na baanabi, tibarikirizisibwa muntu, n'obu yaakuba ozookire omu bafu.<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuteisa abarikuhabya abandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu yaagira abeegi be ati: Ebirikugwisa tibiribura kwija; kwonka oribireeta aryakareeba. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:6">Mat 18:6</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Haakiri ogwo okubohwa orubengo omu bitsya, akanagwa omu nyanja, okukira okureetera omwe ahari aba abato kukora ekibi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21">21</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Mwerinde; mwene sho ku araashiishe, omuhane; ku araayeteise, omusaasire; <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />ku araakukore kubi eizooba rimwe emirundi mushanju, yaakuhindukira emirundi mushanju naagira ati: Nyeteisize; omusaasire.<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Entumwa zaagira Mukama waitu ziti: Twongyereho okwikiriza? <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref>. </char></note> Mukama waitu yaagira ati: Kuri mwine okwikiriza okuri nk'akajuma ka sinaapi, mukaaragiire omusikamoori ogu muti, Higuka, obyarwe omu nyanja, gubahurira.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />N'oha omuriimwe oine omuhuuku orikuhinga, nari orikuriisa entaama, ou yaakugambira naakiruga aha murimo, ati: Rahuka oije, oshutame, orye? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Omu mwanya gw'okumugira ati: Ihura eby'okurya, oyezirikye, ompeereze, okuhitsya obu ndaaheze kurya n'okunywa; bwanyima obone kurya n'okunywa? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Nimugira ngu naasiima omuhuuku ogwo ahabw'okukora eki yaaragiirwa? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Muutyo naimwe, ku muraagume mwaheza kukora byona ebi muragiirwe, mugire muti: Turi abahuuku abataine mugasho; ebi twakora nibyo ebyo ebi tushemereire kukora.<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okushemeza ababembe ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Ku baabaire nibaza Yerusaalemu, yaaraba ahagati ya Samaria na Galilaaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:45">Lev 13:45</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 13:46">46</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaataahire omu kirorero kimwe, yaabuganwa ababembe ikumi, baayemerera hangahari, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />baagamba n'eiraka rihango bati: Yesu Mwegyesa, otugirire embabazi. <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:14">Luk 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabareebire, yaabagira ati: Mwirooko mweyorekye aha banyamurwa. Ku baabaire nibagyenda, baashemezibwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Omwe aharibo, ku yaareebire yaakira, yaakuba, yaagaruka naahimbisa Ruhanga n'eiraka rihango; <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />yaajuumara aha bigyere bya Yesu, yaamusiima. Kandi ogwo akaba ari Omusamaria. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu yaabuuza ati: Abaashemezibwa t'ikumi? Omwenda barahi? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Tihariho n'omwe owaagaruka kuhimbisa Ruhanga, kureka omunyaihanga ogu? <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yaamugira ati: Imuka oyegyendere; okwikiriza kwawe nikwo kwakukiza.<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebiribaho omu biro by'emperu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 18:36">Yoh 18:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabuuziibwe Abafarisaayo obunaku obu obukama bwa Ruhanga buriiziramu, yaabagarukamu ati: Obukama bwa Ruhanga tibwija nibureebwa butunu; <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />kandi tibarigira ngu, Reeba mbubu! Nari, mburiya! Ahakuba obukama bwa Ruhanga buri omuriimwe.<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Yaagira abeegi be ati: Ebiro biryahika obu muryetenga kureeba ekiro kimwe aha biro by'Omwana w'omuntu, haza mutakireebe. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:8">Luk 21:8</ref>. </char></note> Baryabagira bati: Reeba hariya, Reeba aha! Mutarizayo, kandi mutaribakuratira. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:26">Mat 24:26</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku omurabyo gurabiza aha rubaju rumwe rw'eiguru, okumurika kwagwo kukahika aha rundi, nikwo n'Omwana w'omuntu ariba aha kiro kye. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Kwonka ashemereire kubanza kubonabonesibwa omuri bingi, n'okwangwa ab'obusingye obu. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:37-39">Mat 24:37-39</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku kyabaire omu biro bya Noa, nikwo kiriba kityo n'omu biro by'Omwana w'omuntu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:7-23">Kut 7:7-23</ref>. </char></note> Bakaba nibarya, nibanywa, nibashwera, nibahingirwa, okuhitsya aha kiro eki Noa yaataahiireho omu meeri, omwegyemure gw'amaizi gukaija, gukabacwekyereza boona. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20">Kut 18:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'omu biro bya Looti nabyo kikaba kityo; bakaba nibarya, nibanywa, nibagura, nibatunda, nibahinga, nibombeka; <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Kut 19:24</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 19:25">25</ref>. </char></note> kwonka aha kiro eki Looti yaarugiireho omuri Sodoma, omuriro n'ekibiriiti bikagwa okuruga omu iguru, byabacwekyereza boona. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Nikwo kiriba kityo n'aha kiro eki Omwana w'omuntu arishuuruurirwaho. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17">Mat 24:17</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:26">Kut 19:26</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro ekyo oriba ari aha mutwe gw'enju, ebintu bye biri omu nju, ataritemburuka kubiihamu; n'oriba ari omu musiri, nawe atarigaruka. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mwijukye muka Looti. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Omuntu weena orikwenda kukiza amagara ge, aryagabuza; kandi orikubuza amagara ge, aryagakiza. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nimbagambira nti: Aha kiro ekyo abashaija babiri baryaba bari aha kitabo kimwe; omwe aryatwarwa, ondiijo atsigweho. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:40">Mat 24:40</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:41">41</ref>. </char></note> Abakazi babiri baryaba nibasa kumwe; omwe aryatwarwa, ondiijo atsigweho. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Abashaija babiri baryaba bari omu musiri, omwe aryatwarwa, ondiijo atsigweho. <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:28">Mat 24:28</ref>. </char></note> Baagarukamu nibamubuuza bati: Nkahi, Mukama waitu? Yaabagira ati: Ahu omutumbi guri, niho amahungu gateeranira.<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'omuramuzi n'omufaakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:12">Rom 12:12</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:2">Kol 4:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaabacwera enfumu y'okubeegyesa nk'oku bashemereire kushaba obutoosha okutaruha. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Yaabagira ati: Omuri tauni emwe hakaba harimu omuramuzi owaabaire atatiina Ruhanga, n'obu kwakuba okweta aha bantu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Kandi omuri tauni egyo hakaba harimu omufaakazi owaabaire aija obutoosha naamugambira ati: Nshoboorora n'omuzigu wangye. <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ogwo muramuzi yaamara omwanya ayangire; kwonka bwanyima yaagira omu mutima gwe ati: N'obu ndaabe ntatiina Ruhanga, nari okweta aha bantu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />kwonka omufaakazi ogu ahabw'okundusya, naaza kumushoboorora, arekye kuguma naija obutoosha kundusya. <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Mukama waitu yaagira ati: Muhurire omuramuzi otahikiriire eki arikugamba. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Nimugira ngu Ruhanga tarishoboorora entoore ze, ezimutakira nyomushana na nyekiro? Aryazituuzaho? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nimbagambira nti: Aryarahuka kubashoboorora. Beitu Omwana w'omuntu ku ariija, ebyo aryashanga okwikiriza omu nsi?<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okushaba kw'Omufarisaayo n'Omuhooza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Kandi yaacwera enfumu egi abantu bamwe abaabaire nibeemanya ngu bahikiriire, haza nibagaya abandi. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Ati: Abantu babiri bakainamuka omuri hekalu kushaba, omwe akaba ari Omufarisaayo n'ondiijo ari omuhooza. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:2">Isa 58:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 58:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Omufarisaayo yaayemerera wenka, yaashaba ati: Ruhanga, ninkusiima, ahakuba tindi nk'abantu abandi, abanyagi, abatahikiriire, abashambani, nari nk'omuhooza oriya. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:23">Mat 23:23</ref>. </char></note> Nyesiibyakwo kabiri omu saabiiti, mpeereza kimwe kya ikumi kya byona ebi ntunga. <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:1">Zab 51:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omuhooza yaayemerera hangahari, nangwa tiyaayenda n'okwinamura amaisho ge kureeba ahaiguru, kwonka yaayeteerateera omu kifuba, naagira ati: Ruhanga, onsaasire nyowe omusiisi! <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>. </char></note> Nimbagambira nti: Omushaija ogwo akashuuma, yaagaruka owe aihirweho orubanja okukira ori; ahakuba weena orikwetunguura aryagarurwa ahansi; kandi orikwegarura ahansi, aryatunguurwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okushabira abaana omugisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15-17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mak 10:13-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi bakamureetera abaana baabo ngu abakoreho; abeegi be ku baabareebire, baabagambira kubi. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Kwonka Yesu yaabeeta ah'ari, naagira ati: Murekye abaana bato baije ahariinye, mutabazibira, ahabw'okuba obukama bwa Ruhanga n'obw'abari nk'abo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18:3</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omuntu weena otarikwikiriza bukama bwa Ruhanga nk'omwana muto, taributaahamu.<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omutegyeki omutungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18-30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:16-29">Mat 19:16-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-30">Mak 10:17-30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutegyeki omwe yaamubuuza ati: Mwegyesa omurungi, nkaakora ki okuhungura amagara agatahwaho? <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Noonyetera ki omurungi? Tihariho murungi, kureka omwe wenka, niwe Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Noomanya ebiragiro, Otarishambana, Otariita, Otariiba, Otaribeiherera ondiijo, Otiine sho na nyoko. <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Yaagira ati: Ebyo byona nkabyerinda okuruga omu buto bwangye. <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu ku yaakihuriire, yaamugira ati: Mbwenu nooburwaho kimwe; tunda ebi otungire byona, obihe abooro, oryatunga eitungo omu iguru; haza oije, onkuratire. <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ku yaabihuriire, yaagira enaku nyingi, ahabw'okuba akaba ari omutungi munonga. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu ku yaamwetegyereize, yaagira ati: Ka nikiremeera abatungi kutaaha omu bukama bwa Ruhanga! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Nikirahuka engamira kuraba omu nyindo y'empitirizo, okukira omutungi kutaaha omu bukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Abaakihuriire baagira bati: Mbwenu shi hoona, n'oha orikubaasa kujunwa? <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yaabagira ati: Ekitarikubaasika ha bantu nikibaasika ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Petero yaamugira ati: Reeba, itwe tukatsiga ebyaitu, twakukuratira. <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Tihariho muntu owaatsigire enju, nari omukazi, nari beene ishe, nari abazaire be, nari abaana be, ahabw'obukama bwa Ruhanga, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />otariheebwa bingi okukiraho omu biro ebi, kandi omu busingye oburiija akaheebwa amagara agatahwaho.<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okugamba eby'okufa kwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:31-34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mak 10:32-34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Yesu yaayekiikana bari ikumi na babiri, yaabagira ati: Reeba, nitwinamuka Yerusaalemu, byona ebyahandiikirwe baanabi aha Mwana w'omuntu nibiija kuhikiirizibwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Aryaheebwayo aha Banyamahanga, baryamushungisa, bamugire kubi, bamucwere amacwante; <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />baryamwasha, baryamwita, kandi aha kiro kya kashatu aryazooka. <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Kwonka tibaashoborokyerwa kigambo na kimwe ahari ebyo, ahabw'okuba ekigambo ekyo kikaba kibasherekirwe, tibaamanya bi baagambirwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuhumuura empumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:35-43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mak 10:46-52</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yairiire haihi na Yeriko, yaashanga empumi eshutami aha rubaju rw'omuhanda neesheega. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Ku yaahuriire omutwe gw'abantu nigurabaho, egyo mpumi yaabuuza eti: N'enki ekyo? <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Baagigira bati: Yesu owa Nazareesi niwe arikuhingura. <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Yaayeta munonga ati: Yesu, Omwana wa Daudi, ngirira embabazi. <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Abaabaire beebembeire baagigambira kubi, nibagicureeza; kwonka yo yaakizaho kweta munonga eti: Iwe Mwana wa Daudi, ngirira embabazi! <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu yaayemerera, yaaragiira ku bagimureetera; ku yaamuhikire, yaagibuuza ati: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />Nooyenda ngu nkukorere ki? Yaagira eti: Mukama wangye, niinyenda ngu mpumuukye. <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu yaagigira ati: Humuuka; okwikiriza kwawe nikwo kwakukiza. <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Ahonaaho yaahumuuka, yaamukuratira naahimbisa Ruhanga; n'abantu boona ku baakireebire, baasiima Ruhanga.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Zakaayo omuhooza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yaataaha omuri Yeriko, yaagumizamu naahingura. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Kandi hakaba hariho omushaija orikwetwa Zakaayo omuhooza mukuru, kandi omutungi. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Yaayenda kureeba oku Yesu arikushusha; kwonka tiyaabaasa ahabw'omutwe gw'abantu, kandi n'ahabw'okuba mugufu. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />N'ahabw'ekyo yairuka, yaaza omu maisho, yaatemba omuti gw'omusikamoori, ngu amureebe; ahakuba akaba naija kuraba aho. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu ku yaahikire omu mwanya ogwo, yaareeba ahaiguru, yaamugira ati: Zakaayo, rahuka, temburuka; ahabw'okuba erizooba nshemereire kusiiba omu nju yaawe. <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Yaarahuka kutemburuka, yaamutaasya owe ashemereirwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:2">Luk 15:2</ref>. </char></note> Abantu boona ku baakireebire, baayetomboita, nibagira bati: Yaaza kuraarira omuntu omusiisi. <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:1">Kur 22:1</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 5:6">Kub 5:6</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 5:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Zakaayo yaayemerera, yaagambira Mukama ati: Reeba, Mukama wangye, ekicweka ky'ebintu byangye naaza kukigabira abooro; kandi ou naagobeize weena, nimmuriha kana. <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:31">Byak 16:31</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugira ati: Eri izooba okujunwa kwataaha omu nju egi, ahakuba ogu nawe n'omwana wa Abrahamu; <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:16">Ezk 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:15">1 Tim 1:15</ref>. </char></note> kandi Omwana w'omuntu akaija kusherura n'okujuna ekyabuzire.<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu ya miina ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11-27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baahuriire ebyo, yaagaruka yaacwa enfumu, ahabw'okuba akaba ari haihi na Yerusaalemu, kandi bakateekateeka ngu obukama bwa Ruhanga bwaza kureebwa omu bunaku obwo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:21">Luk 24:21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6">Byak 1:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Nikyo yaagiriire ati: Omunyiginya omwe akagyenda omu nsi ya hare kuheebwa obugabe ngu bwanyima agarukye. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Yaayeta <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Rugriika n'omuhuuku. </char></note>abambari be ikumi, yaabaha miina ikumi, yabaragiriira ati: Muzishuubuze, okuhitsya obu ndigaruka. <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:11">Yoh 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abantu be bakaba nibamwanga; baamukuratsa entumwa, nibagira bati: Titurikwenda muntu ogwo ku atutegyeka. <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Ku yaagarukire, aheirwe obugabe, yaaragiira kumwetera abambari abo abu yaahaire empiiha, ngu amanye enshaagi ezi baihire omu kushuubura kwabo. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ow'okubanza yaija omu maisho ge, yaagira ati: Mukama wangye, miina yaawe eshaagizemu ezindi miina ikumi. <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:10">Luk 16:10</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Okozire gye, mwambari wangye omurungi! Ahakuba oyesigirwe ahari bikye munonga, obe omutegyeki w'endembo ikumi. <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />N'owa kabiri yaija, yaagira ati: Mukama wangye, miina yaawe eshaagizemu ezindi miina itaano. <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Yaamugira ati: Naiwe otegyekye endembo itaano. <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />N'ondiijo yaija, yaagira ati: Mukama wangye, miina yaawe ngigi! Nkagibiika omu kiremu. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ahakuba nkakutiina, ahabw'okuba oba omuntu ogumire; oyaanura ebi otaanikire; ogyesha ebi otabibire. <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Yaamugira ati: Iwe mwambari 'we omubi, ninkucwera orubanja, niinyiha aha bi waagamba. Okamanya ku ndi omuntu ogumire, ku nyanura ebi ntaanikire, nkagyesha ebi ntabibire. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Mbwenu n'enki ekyakuzibiire kuha empiiha zangye abazibiika kuzishuubuza, naanye ku naakugarukire, nkaaziihireyo n'enshaagi? <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Yaagambira abaabaire beemereire aho ati: Mumwakye miina egyo, mugihe oine miina ikumi. <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Baamugira bati: Mukama waitu, ka aine ezindi ikumi! <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13:12</ref>. </char></note> Nimbagambira nti: Oine niwe aryongyerwa; kwonka otaine aryayakwa n'eki aine. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Kandi abo bazigu bangye abatarenzire ku mbategyeka, mubareete aha, mubaitire omu maisho gangye.<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutaaha Yerusaalemu n'ekitiinisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Ku yaaherize kugamba ebyo, yaagumizamu kwinamuka Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29-38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:1-9">Mat 21:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-10">Mak 11:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-16">Yoh 12:12-16</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaahikire haihi na Besifaage na Besania aha kibungo ekirikwetwa Zeituuni, yaatuma babiri aha beegi be, yaagira ati: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Mugyende omu kirorero ekibari omu maisho; ku muraabe nimutaahamu, nimwija kushanga omwana gw'endogoya gutsibikire, ogutakatembwahoga muntu; mugutsibure, mugureete aha. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Omuntu weena, ku araababuuze ati: Nimugutsiburira ki? Mugarukyemu muti: Mukama waitu naagwenda. <verse eid="LUK 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Abo abatumirwe baagyenda, baashanga kiri nk'oku yaabagambira. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Ku baabaire nibatsibura omwana gw'endogoya, bakama baagwo baababuuza bati: Nimutsiburira ki omwana gw'endogoya? <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Baabagarukamu bati: Mukama waitu naagwenda. <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Baagureetera Yesu, baagutaho ebijwaro byabo, baagumushutamyaho. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Ku yaabaire naagyenda, baayara ebijwaro byabo omu nguuto. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Ku yairiire haihi, yaahika aha kashuumo k'ekibungo kya Zeituuni, omutwe gwona gw'abeegi be gwatandika kushemererwa n'okuhimbisa Ruhanga n'eiraka rihango ahabw'eby'okutangaaza ebi baareebire, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Zab 118:26</ref>. </char></note> nibagira bati: Omugabe orikwija omu iziina rya Mukama asiimwe! Obusingye bube omu iguru, n'ekitiinisa kibe ahaiguru ya byona. <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Bamwe aha Bafarisaayo abaabaire bari omu mutwe ogwo, baamugira bati: Mwegyesa, hana abeegi baawe. <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Nimbagambira nti: Aba ku baakuhunama, amabaare gakaagamba munonga.<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuririra Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:35">Yoh 11:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yairiire haihi, yaareeba orurembo, yaaruririra, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:29">Bir 32:29</ref>. </char></note> naagira ati: Eri izooba, kuri noomanya ebyakukureetera obusingye! Kwonka shi hati bisherekirwe amaisho gaawe. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ahakuba ebiro biryakwizira, abazigu baawe bakuzitireho orugo, bakwehinguririze, bakutangatangye embaju zoona; <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:6">Luk 21:6</ref>. </char></note> bakuteere ahansi n'abaana baawe abakutwiremu; tibarikutsigamu ibaare eriri aha rindi, ahabw'okuba toramanyire biro eby'okutaayaayirwa kwawe.<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:45-48: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:12-16">Mat 21:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-18">Mak 11:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Yoh 2:13-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaataaha omuri hekalu, yaatandika kubingamu abaabaire nibatunda, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yer 7:11</ref>. </char></note> yaabagira ati: Kikahandiikwa ngu, Enju yangye eryaba ey'okushabirwamu; mbwenu imwe mugihindwire enyanga y'abambuzi. <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:53">Luk 22:53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:20">Yoh 18:20</ref>. </char></note> Yaaguma naayegyesa obutoosha omuri hekalu. Kwonka abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki n'abakuru b'abantu baacwa obwengye oku baraamwite; <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />baabura eki baraakore, ahakuba abantu boona bakata omutima munonga aha bigambo bye.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abanyamurwa okubuuza Yesu ahu yaihire obushoboorozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1-8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mak 11:27-33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha izooba rimwe, ku yaabaire naayegyesa abantu omuri hekalu, naabuurira engiri, abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki n'abakuru baija ah'ari, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />baamugira bati: tugambire, ni bushoboorozi ki oburikukukoresa ebi, kandi n'oha owaakuhaire obushoboorozi obu? <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Reka naanye mbabuuze ekigambo kimwe, haza mungarukyemu. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Okubatiza kwa Yohaana kukaruga omu iguru nari omu bantu? <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Baahanuura bonka nibagira bati: Ku turaagire tuti, Kukaruga omu iguru, naatugarukamu ati, Kandi shi, n'enki ekyabazibiire kumwikiriza? <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Kandi ku turaagire tuti, Kukaruga omu bantu, abantu boona nibaija kututeera amabaare, ahakuba nibahamiza kimwe ngu Yohaana akaba ari nabi. <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Baagarukamu ngu tibarikumanya ei kwarugire. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu nikwo kubagira ati: Naanye tindikwija kubagambira bushoboorozi oburikunkoresa ebi.<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'abahingi ababi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mak 12:1-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaatandika kucwera abantu enfumu egi, ati: Omuntu akabyara omusiri gw'emizaabibu, yaagutsigamu abahingi, yaagyenda omu nsi endiijo, yaamarayo ebiro bingi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa 5:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15">2 Bus 36:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 36:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Obunaku bw'okwera ku bwahikire, yaatuma omuhuuku we ahari abo bahingi, ngu bamutwekyere aha byana by'emizaabibu. Abahingi baamuteera, baamubinga, yaagarukayo engaro nsha. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Yaagaruka yaabatumaho ondiijo muhuuku, nawe baamuteera, baamuhemangura, baamubinga, yaagarukayo engaro nsha. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Nabwo yaagaruka yaabatumaho owa kashatu; ogwo baamuhutaaza, baamunaga aheeru. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Mukama w'omusiri gw'emizaabiru yaagira ati: Ngire nta? Niinyija kutuma omwana wangye ou ndikukunda; shana baryamuha ekitiinisa. <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Kwonka abahingi abo ku baamureebire, baacuma enaama bonka, nibagira bati: Ogu niwe muhunguzi; murekye tumwite, obuhunguzi bube obwaitu. <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Baamubinga omu musiri gw'emizaabibu, baamwita. Mbwenu mukama w'ogwo musiri aryabagira ata? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Aryaija, acwekyereze abo bahingi, n'ogwo musiri gw'emizaabibu aguhe abandi. Ku baakihuriire, baagira bati; Nikikabure! <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Zab 118:22</ref>. </char></note> Yaabeetegyereza, yaagira ati: Ekyahandiikirwe eki nikishoboorora ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">Eibaare eri abombeki baayangire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">Niryo ryahindukire erikuru ery'obuhamizo bw'enju.<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:14">Isa 8:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena origwa aha ibaare eryo aryahendagurika; kwonka weena ou ririgwera riryamucwa obusaasingo. <verse eid="LUK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Omu mwanya ogwo abahandiiki n'abanyamurwa abakuru baacwa obwengye kumukwata, kwonka baatiina abantu; ahabw'okuba bakamanya ngu nibo yaarengyeza.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abafarisaayo okumutegyesa eby'omushoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:20-26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mak 12:13-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baamugumyaho eriisho, baatuma abantu nk'entatsi, ezaayegizire nk'abahikiriire, ngu bamwiheho ekigambo, babone kumuhayo omu mikono y'Omutegyeki n'omu bushoboorozi bwe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:54">Luk 11:54</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Baamubuuza bati: Mwegyesa, nitumanya ngu ogamba kandi oyegyesa omuhanda gwa Ruhanga omu mazima. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Ebiragiro nibiikiriza okuha Kaisaari omushoro, nari tikwo? <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ku yaamanyire oburyarya bwabo, yaabagira ati: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />Muunyorekye edenaari. Ekishushani n'ebihandiikirweho n'eby'oha? Baagira bati: N'ebya Kaisaari. <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yaabagira ati: Mbwenu nu ebya Kaisaari mubihe Kaisaari, n'ebya Ruhanga mubihe Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Tibaabaasa kumwihaho kigambo omuri ebyo omu maisho g'abantu; baatangaarira okugarukamu kwe, baahunama.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abasadukaayo okuhakanisa okuzooka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:27-40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 22:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mak 12:18-27</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 12:34">34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima bamwe aha Basadukaayo, abahakana ku hatariho kuzooka, baija ah'ari; baamubuuza bati: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Bir 25:5</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 25:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Mwegyesa, Musa akatuhandiikira ngu, Mwene ishe w'omuntu, ku arishwera omukazi, yaafa atakazaire nawe, omurumuna ahungure omukazi ogwo, amumuzaarireho abaana. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Mbwenu hakaba hariho enyineemwe mushanju; mukuru waabo yaashwera omukazi, yaafa atakamuzaireho mwana; <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />n'owa kabiri nikwo; <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />n'owa kashatu yaamuhungura, okuhitsya boona mushanju obu bahweireho batamuzaireho baana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Bwanyima omukazi nawe yaabakurata, yaafa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Mbwenu omu kuzooka aryaba muka oha? Ahabw'okuba boona mushanju bakamushwera. <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Abaana b'obusingye obu bashwera kandi bahingirwa; <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />kwonka abarikuteekateekwa ku bashemereire kuhika omu busingye obwo n'aha kuzooka kw'abafu, tibarishwera, kandi tibarihingirwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Tibaribaasa kufa bwa kabiri, ahakuba baryashusha nka baamaraika; kandi n'abaana ba Ruhanga, ahabw'okuba n'abaana b'okuzooka. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:2">Kur 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Ebirikukwata aha by'okuzooka kw'abafu, na Musa akabyoreka omu byahandiikirwe aha byabaire aha Rushaka, ahu yaayeteire Mukama eiziina Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, Ruhanga wa Isaaka, kandi Ruhanga wa Yakobo. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Ruhanga ti Ruhanga w'abafu, kureka ow'abahuriire; ahakuba omu maisho ge boona baba abahuriire.<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omwana wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bamwe aha bahandiiki baagarukamu bati: Mwegyesa, waagamba gye. <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Okuruga aho tihaine waagarukire kumuturukirira kumubuuza ekindi. <verse eid="LUK 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:41-44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:41-45">Mat 22:41-45</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mak 12:35-37</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaababuuza ati: Nibabaasa bata kuhamya ngu Kristo n'Omwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zab 110:1</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Daudi we omu kitabo kya Zaaburi naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Mukama akagambira Mukama wangye ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Shutama aha rubaju rwangye rwa buryo,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Okuhitsya obu ndigira abazigu baawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:43">Akatebe k'ebigyere byawe.<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Ahabw'ekyo Daudi, ku araabe amweta Mukama we, naabaasa ata kuba omwana we? <verse eid="LUK 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:45-47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:1">Mat 23:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 23:5-7">5-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 23:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mak 12:38-40</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaagambira abeegi be, abantu boona bahuriire, ati:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:46">Luk 11:46</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />Mwerinde abahandiiki, abakunda kugyenda bajwaire ebijwaro biraingwa, n'okutangarirwa omu katare, n'ebitebe by'ekitiinisa omuri sinagogi, n'emyanya y'ekitiinisa omu magyenyi, <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />abanyaga enju z'abafaakazi, kandi abarandagatana omu kushaba, haza nibaryarya; abo baryacwerwa orubanja orurikukira obuhango.<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omufakazi omworo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1-4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mak 12:41-44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yainamura amaisho, yaareeba abatungi abaabaire nibata ebiconco byabo omu ibiikiro. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Kandi yaareba n'omufaakazi omworo naatamu obusente bubiri. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:12">2 Kor 8:12</ref>. </char></note> Yaagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omufaakazi oriya omworo yaatamu bingi okukira bariya boona; <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />ahakuba bo baatamu aha bibashaagire; kwonka omufaakazi oriya omu bworo bwe yaatamu ebi aine byona, kandi niryo itungo rye heza.<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebirikumanyisa okuhwerekyerera kwa Yerusaalemu n'okugaruka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:5-24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:1-21">Mat 24:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-19">Mak 13:1-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bamwe, ku baabaire nibagamba ahari hekalu, oku ecumirwe n'amabaare ag'obuguzi bwingi n'ebihairweyo, yaagira ati: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:44">Luk 19:44</ref>. </char></note> Ebi byona ebi murikureeba, ebiro biryaija, tihariho ibaare eriritsigara riri aha rindi eritarinagwa hansi. <verse eid="LUK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Baamubuuza bati: Mwegyesa, beitu ebyo biryabaho ryari? Kandi ni kamanyiso ki akaryoreka obunaku obu ebyo byona biribeeraho? <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yaagira ati: Mwerinde, mutarihabisibwa; ahabw'okuba baingi baryaija omu iziina ryangye, nibagira bati: Niinye Kristo! Kandi bati: Obunaku buri haihi! Mutaribakuratira. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Kandi ku murihurira engamba n'okujagarara, mutaritiina; ahabw'okuba ebyo bishemereire kubanza kubaho; kwonka emperu terihika ahonaaho.<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Yaagaruka yaabagira ati: Eihanga riryateera erindi ihanga n'obugabe buryateera obundi; <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />haryabaho emitsitsa y'amaani, n'enjara n'orufu omu myanya mingi; haryabaho ebirikutiinisa n'obumanyiso bukuru oburikuruga omu iguru. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ebyo byona ku biriba bitakabaireho, baryabakwata, babahiigye, babaheyo omuri sinagogi n'omu bihome, babatware omu maisho g'abagabe n'abategyeki, nibabatura eiziina ryangye. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Obwo buryaba obunaku bwanyu bw'okuba abajurizi. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19">Mat 10:19</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo eki mukihamye omu mitima yaanyu, ku mutariteekateeka by'okwetonganira, obunaku butakahikire; <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:10">Byak 6:10</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba ndyabaha orurimi n'obwengye, ebi abazigu baanyu bataribaasa kurwanisa n'obu kwakuba okuhakanisa. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Muryaheebwayo abazaire baanyu, na beene shoimwe, n'abanyaruganda, n'abanywani baanyu; baryabaitisa bamwe ahariimwe; <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />muryayangwa abantu boona ahabw'eiziina ryangye. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:7">Luk 12:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka n'akashokye k'aha mitwe yaanyu tikaribura. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:36">Heb 10:36</ref>. </char></note> Omukwehangaana nimwo murijunira amagara gaanyu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Ku murireeba Yerusaalemu eyehinguririziibwe engabo, obwo muryamanya ngu okuhwerekyerera kwayo kuri haihi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Obwo abari Buyudaaya bahungire aha nshozi, n'abariba bari omu rurembo bashohore; n'abariba bari omu byaro batarirutaahamu. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:29">Yer 5:29</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ebiro ebyo nibyo biriba eby'okuhooreramu enzigu, ngu Ebyahandiikirwe byona bihikiirire. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:26">1 Kor 7:26</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyo abariba baine enda n'abarikwontsya baryareeba enaku! Ahakuba omu nsi haryabamu obusaasi bwingi, kandi n'ekiniga aha ihanga eri. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:18">Isa 63:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:1">Zab 79:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:2">Kush 11:2</ref>. </char></note> Abantu baryaitwa rurara, baryanyagwa batwarwe omu mahanga goona; na Yerusaalemu eryaguma neeribatiirirwa abanyamahanga, okuhitsya obu obusingye bw'Abanyamahanga burihwaho.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24:29</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-26">Mak 13:24-26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haryabaho obumanyiso aha izooba n'aha kwezi n'aha nyonyoozi, kandi aha nsi amahanga garyashaasha, gashobeirwe ahabw'okuhoorera kw'enyanja n'ebingonzi; <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa 34:4</ref>. </char></note> abantu bahahaaze emitima ahabw'obwoba n'okutegyereza ekirikwenda kwija aha nsi; ahabw'okuba eby'amaani eby'omu iguru biryatengyetsibwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:64">Mat 26:64</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima y'ebyo baryareeba Omwana w'omuntu naizira omu kicu aine obushoboorozi n'ekitiinisa kingi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Kandi ebi ku biritandika kubaho, mureebe ahaiguru, mwimutsye emitwe yaanyu, ahakuba okucungurwa kwanyu kuryaba kuri haihi. <verse eid="LUK 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29-33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mak 13:28-31</ref>. </char></note> Yaabacwera enfumu ati: Mwetegyereze omutiini n'emiti endiijo yoona; <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />ku etooka amababi, mwagareeba, mumanya ku obunaku bw'okugyesha buri haihi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />N'ahabw'ekyo naimwe ku murireeba ebyo nibibaho, mumanye ngu obukama bwa Ruhanga buri haihi. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Obusingye obu tiburihwaho, ebyo byona bitakabaireho. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Eiguru n'ensi biryahwaho, kwonka ebigambo byangye tibirihwaho.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 17:27">Luk 17:27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:19">Mak 4:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:49">Mat 24:49</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka mwerinde, emitima yaanyu etakaaremesibwa omururu n'obusinzi n'amaganya g'amagara aga, ekiro ekyo kikabagwaho mutakimanyire, nk'orugogo; <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:3">1 Tes 5:3</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba kiryahika aha bantu boona abatwire omu nsi yoona. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:17">Kush 6:17</ref>. </char></note> Mugume nimureeba obutwire bwona, nimushaba ngu mubaase kukira ebyo byona ebiribaho, n'okwemerera omu maisho g'Omwana w'omuntu.<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Kandi buri izooba akaba ayegyesa omuri hekalu; omu mwabazyo araara omu kibungo kya Zeituuni; <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />omu kasheeshe munonga abantu boona bamushanga omuri hekalu kumuhurira.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda okutunda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1-2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mak 14:1</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi obugyenyi bw'Emigaati etatumbisiibwe oburikwetwa Okuhingurwaho bukaba nibwenda kuhika. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki baacwa obwengye oku baramwite, ahakuba bakaba nibatiina abantu, <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10">Mak 14:10</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Sitaane yaataaha omuri Yuda, orikwetwa Iskaryota, owaabaire ari omwe ahari ikumi na babiri,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:2">Yoh 13:2</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:27">27</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yaagyenda yaahanuura n'abanyamurwa abakuru n'abaserukare, oku araamubareebeze. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Baashemererwa, baaraganisa kumuha empiiha. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yaikiriza, yaasherura oburyo bw'okumubareebeza, ahu omutwe gw'abantu gutari.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okurya Okuhingurwaho n'abeegi be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:7-23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:17-29">Mat 26:17-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-25">Mak 14:12-25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ekiro ky'Emigaati etatumbisiibwe kyahika; nikyo kiro ekyabaire kitambirwaho omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:18-20">Kur 12:18-20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu yaatuma Petero na Yohaana naagira ati: Mugyende, mututebeekanisize Okuhingurwaho, turye. <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Baamubuuza bati: Nooyenda ngu tukutebeekanisize nkahi? <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yaabagira ati: Reeba, ku muraataahe omu rurembo, nimwija kubuganwa omushaija oyekoreire enjoga y'amaizi; mumukurate omu nju ei araataahemu. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Mugire nyineeka muti: Omwegyesa yaakutumaho, naakubuuza ngu; Ekishengye ky'abagyenyi kirahi, omu araariire Okuhingurwaho n'abeegi be? <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Naija kubooreka ekishengye kihango eky'ahaiguru ekicumirwe; mutubonereze omwo. <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Baagyenda, baashanga biri nk'oku yaabagambira; baatebeekanisa Okuhingurwaho.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Eshaaha ku zaahikire, yaashutama aha by'okurya hamwe n'entumwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Yaabagira ati: Nyetengire munonga kuriira hamwe naimwe Okuhingurwaho oku, ntakabonabonesiibwe; <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />ahakuba nimbagambira nti: Tindirya Kuhingurwaho okundi, okuhitsya obu kurihikiirizibwa omu bukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Yaakwata ekikopo; ku yaaherize kusiima, yaagira ati: Mukwate eki, mukibagane, <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />ahakuba nimbagambira nti: Tindinywa aha byana by'emizaabibu, okuruga hati okuhitsya obu obukama bwa Ruhanga buriija.<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11:23-25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaakwata omugaati; ku yaaherize kusiima yaagubega, yaagubaha, naagira ati; Ogu n'omubiri gwangye, ogwaheebwayo ahabwanyu; mugume mukore mutyo okuunyijukiraho. <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kur 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31">Yer 31:31</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kurya, yaakwata atyo n'ekikopo, yaagira ati: Ekikopo eki niyo ndagaano ensya ehamibwa eshagama yangye, esheesheka ahabwanyu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:21">Yoh 13:21</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, omukono gw'orikundeebya guri hamwe naanye aha meeza; <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />buzimazima Omwana w'omuntu naagyenda, nk'oku kyamuteekateekyeirwe; kwonka orikumureebya aryareeba enaku! <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Baatandika kubuuzana bonka ngu, N'oha aharibo orikwenda kukora ekyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukuru omu bukama bwa Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luk 9:46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi bakagira empaka, ngu n'oha omuribo orikuteekateekwaho kuba mukuru. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mat 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mak 10:42-44</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagambira ati: Abagabe b'Abanyamahanga babategyeka; n'abaine obushoboorozi aharibo beetwa Abahwezi b'abantu. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Kwonka imwe mutariba mutyo; omukuru omuriimwe abe nk'omuto; kandi orikutegyeka abe nk'orikuheereza. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:4-14">Yoh 13:4-14</ref>. </char></note> Beitu omukuru n'oha, oshutami aha by'okurya, nari orikuheereza? T'ogwo oshutami aha by'okurya? Kwonka nyowe ndi ahagati yaanyu nk'omuheereza. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Kandi niimwe abaagumisiriize naanye omu bi naagyeziibwe; <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:32">Luk 12:32</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku Tata yambiikiire obukama, naanye mbubabiikiire, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref>. </char></note> ngu muriire, kandi munywere aha meeza yangye omu bukama bwangye; kandi ngu mushutame aha bitebe by'obugabe, mucwere enganda za Israeli ikumi na ibiri emanja.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okugamba oku Petero araamwehakane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:31-34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mak 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh 13:36-38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Mukama waitu yaagira ati: Simooni, Simooni, Sitaane akashaba ngu abashungure nk'oburo;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:11">2 Kor 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:9">Amo 9:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:11">Yoh 17:11</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 17:15">15</ref>. </char></note> kwonka nyowe nkakushabira, ngu okwikiriza kwawe kutahwaho; kandi iwe, ku oriheza kuhinduka, ohamye ab'eishe-emwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Mukama wangye, nyeteekateekire kugyenda naiwe omu kihome, n'omu kufa. <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu yaagira ati: Ninkugambira iwe Petero, eri izooba enkoko terikwija kugamba, otakeehakaine kashatu ku otarikummanya.<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Luk 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaababuuza ati: Ku naabatumire mutaine nshaho y'empiiha, nari efurebe, n'obu zaakuba enkaito, mwine eki mwabuzirwe? Baagarukamu ngu, Ngaaha. <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yaabagira ati: Mbwenu hati, oine enshaho y'empiiha, agihagatire, n'oine efurebe atyo; kandi otabiine, atunde omunagiro gwe, agure rurara. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nimbagambira nti: Ekyahandiikirwe eki kishemerire kuhikiirira ahariinye ngu, Akabarirwa hamwe n'abasiisi, ahabw'okuba ebyampandiikirweho nibyenda kuhika. <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Baamugira bati: Mukama waitu, reeba zaarurara ibiri nzizi! Yaabagira ati: Ka bihwere aho!<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okushaba n'obusaasi omuri Gesesemaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:39-46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:30">Mat 26:30</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:26">Mak 14:26</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">32-42</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaashohora, yaatemba aha rushozi rwa Zeituuni, nk'omucwe gwe oku gwabaire guri; abeegi be baamukuratira. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ku yaahikire okwo, yaabagira ati: Mushabe murekye kuza omu kwohibwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Yaabeeshorooramu hakye nk'aharikurekyerwa eibaare; yaatsimba amaju, yaashaba ati: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Taata, ku oraabe noikiriza, onyiheho ekikopo eki; kwonka kirekye kuba nk'oku ndikwenda, kureka nka Iwe oku orikwenda. <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:5">1 Bag 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:23">Byak 27:23</ref>. </char></note> Maraika yaamweyoreka naaruga omu iguru, yaamugumya. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ku yaasaasire munonga, yaayezirika kushaba; etuutu ye yaashusha nk'amatondo mahango g'eshagama omu kuragarika ahansi. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Ku yaaherize kushaba, yaimuka, yaija aha beegi be, yaashanga bagwejegyeire ahabw'okuganya; <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />yaababuuza ati: Ahabw'enki mugwejegyeire? Mwimukye, mushabe, murekye kuza omu kwohibwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okukwata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:47-53: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-49">Mak 14:43-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:2-11">Yoh 18:2-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabaire naakigamba, haija omutwe gw'abantu, n'ogwo orikwetwa Yuda, omwe ahari ikumi na babiri, abeebembeire; yairira haihi Yesu kumunywegyera. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yesu yaamubuuza ati: Yuda, noorebya Omwana w'omuntu n'okunywegyera? <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Abaabaire bamuhereire, ku baareebire ebyaza kubaho, baabuuza bati: Mukama waitu, tubateme na zaarurara? <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Omwe aharibo yaatema omuhuuku w'omunyamurwa omukuru, yaamucwaho okutu kwa buryo. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Yesu yaagira ati: Murekyere aho! Yaamukora aha kutu, yaamukiza. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Yesu yaabuuza abanyamurwa abakuru n'abakuru b'abaserukare ba hekalu, n'abandi bakuru, abamuhururiire, ati: Mukampururiire nk'oku bahururira omwambuzi na zaarurara n'ebikoni? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:30">Yoh 7:30</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:20">8:20</ref>. </char></note> Obu naabaire ntuura naimwe omuri hekalu, timurantaireho ngaro kunkwata; kwonka obunaku obu n'obwanyu, kandi n'obw'obushoboorozi bw'omwirima.<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okwehakana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:54-62: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:57">Mat 26:57</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:58">58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53">Mak 14:53</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:54">54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoh 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baamukwata, baamutwara, baamutaasya omu nju y'omunyamurwa omukuru; kandi Petero yaamukuratira naamugyenda hare. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ku baaherize kuhemba omuriro omu kibuga ahagati, baashutama hamwe ahansi, na Petero yaashutama ahagati yaabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Omuzaana yaamureeba ashutami aharikuhweza; ku yaamwetegyereize, yaagira ati: Omushaija ogu nawe abaire ari hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Petero yaayehakana naagira ati: Mukazi 'we, tindikumumanya. <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ku hahingwireho akaanya kakye, ondiijo yaamureeba, yaagira ati: Naiwe ori owaabo. Petero yaagira ati: Mushaija 'we, tindi waabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Kandi bwanyima y'eshaaha nk'emwe n'ondiijo yaamwomesereza ati: Buzima omushaija ogu yaaba ari hamwe nawe; ahabw'okuba n'Omunyagalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Kwonka Petero yaagira ati: Mushaija 'we, tindikumanya ki orikugamba. Ahonaaho, ku yaabaire naakigamba, enkoko yaagamba. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Mukama waitu yaahinduka, yaareeba Petero, Petero yaijuka ekigambo kya Mukama waitu, oku amugizire ati: Enkoko etakagambire, noija kuunyehankana kashatu. <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Yaashohora aheeru, yaarira munonga.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abanyamurwa okucwera Yesu orubanja rw'okumwita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:63-65: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:67">Mat 26:67</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:68">68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mak 14:65</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abashaija abaabaire bakwaitse Yesu, baamuteerera enaku, baamuteera. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Baamukoma aha maisho, baamugira bati: Gamba; owaakuteera n'oha? <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Baamugambaho n'ebindi bingi, nibamujuma.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:66-71: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mak 14:55-64</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku bwaseesire, omutwe gw'abakuru b'eihanga eryo baateerana hamwe n'abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki; baamutwara omu ishengyero ryabo, nibagira bati: <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:67: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:24">Yoh 10:24</ref>. </char></note> Ku oraabe ori Kristo, tugambire. Yaabagarukamu ati: N'obu ndaabagambire, timurikwija kwikiriza; <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />kandi n'obu naakubabuuza, timukangarukamu. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:69: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka okuruga hati Omwana w'omuntu aryashutama aha rubaju rwa buryo rw'Obushoboorozi bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Boona baamubuuza bati: Iwe shi, ori Omwana wa Ruhanga? Yaabagarukamu ati: Ndi We nk'oku mwagamba. <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Baagira bati: Kandi nitukyendera ki obwamushinja obundi? Ahabw'okuba itwe twayehuririra ebyaruga omu kanwa ke.<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Pilaato okucwera Yesu orubanja rw'okubambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1-25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:2">Mat 27:2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-31">11-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-20">Mak 15:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-19:16">Yoh 18:28—19:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutwe gwabo boona baimuka, baamutwara omu maisho ga Pilaato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Baatandika kumutabaariza, nibagira bati: omuntu ogu tukamureeba naahabisa eihanga ryaitu, naazibira abantu kushorera Kaisaari, naayehamya ku ari Kristo Omukama. <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:13">1 Tim 6:13</ref>. </char></note> Pilaato yaamubuuza ati: Weeza ori Omugabe w'Abayudaaya? Yaamugarukamu ati: Nikwo kiri nk'oku waagamba. <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilaato yaagira abanyamurwa abakuru n'omutwe gw'abantu ati: Tindikureeba rubanja aha mushaija ogu. <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Kwonka bo baayeyongyera kuhamisiriza, nibagira bati: Naagomesa abantu, naayegyesa omuri Buyudaaya yoona, okuruga Galilaaya nangwa n'okuhika omu mwanya ogu. <verse eid="LUK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilaato ku yaahuriire atyo, yaababuuza omushaija ogwo ku araabe ari owa Galilaaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:1">Luk 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaamanyire ngu n'ow'omu butegyeki bwa Heroode, yaamutweka ahari Heroode, owaabaire ari Yerusaalemu omu biro ebyo.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu omu maisho ga Heroode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:9">Luk 9:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Heroode ku yaareebire Yesu, yaashemererwa munonga, ahabw'okuba okuruga kare akaba ayetenga kumureeba; ahakuba akaba yaamuhuriireho, yaaguma n'amatsiko g'okureeba naakora eky'okureeberaho. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Yaamubuuza ebigambo bingi; kwonka We tiyaamugarukamu. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki baayemerera aho, nibamutabaariza n'amaani. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Heroode n'abaserukare be baamugaya, baamuteerera enaku, baamujweka ebijwaro ebirikwengyengyeta, yaamugarurira Pilaato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Ahari ekyo kiro Heroode na Pilaato baihaho omukago, ahabw'okuba kare bakaba nibangana. <verse eid="LUK 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilaato nikwo kuteerana abanyamurwa abakuru n'abategyeki n'abandi bantu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />akabagira ati: Mwandeetera omushaija ogu, ngu ahabisa abantu; nyowe ahabwangye ku naamubuuriza munonga omu maisho gaanyu, tinaamureebaho rubanja omuri ebyo ebi mumutabaaririize; <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />nangwa n'obu yaakuba Heroode, ahakuba nawe yaamutugarurira. Nimureeba ku atakozire ekishemereire kumwitsa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />N'ahabw'ekyo naaza kumuteera, mmurekure. [<verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Ekyo akakigamba, ahabw'okuba akaba ashemereire kubabohoororera embohe emwe aha bugyenyi obwo.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Boona baayombera hamwe, bati: Ihaho omushaija ogu, oturekurire Barabba. <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Niwe mushaija owaabaire atairwe omu kihome, atuzirwe obugomi obwabaire buri omu rurembo, kandi n'obwitsi) <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilaato, ahabw'okwenda kurekura Yesu, yaagaruka yaagamba nabo; <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />kwonka baayomba munonga, nibagira bati: Mubambe, omubambe aha musharaba! <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Yaabagambira obwa kashatu, naabagira ati: Ahanki? Ni kicumuro ki omuntu ogu eki acumwire? Tinaamureebaho rubanja orushemereire kumwitsa; n'ahabw'ekyo naaza kumuteera, mmurekure. <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Baamugyemesereza nibayomba munonga, nibamushaba ngu abambwe; amaraka gaabo gaarugaho gaamuremesa. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Pilaato nikwo kucwa orubanja ngu eki barikufa kibe nikyo kyakorwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Yaarekura omushaija ou bamushabire, owaabaire atairwe omu kihome ahabw'obugomi n'obwitsi; kandi yaahayo Yesu, ku bamukora nk'oku barikwenda.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakazi ba Yerusaalemu okuririra Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:32">Mat 27:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mak 15:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibamutwara, baakwata omushaija orikwetwa Simooni owa Kureene, owaabaire naaruga omu byaro, baamukorera omusharaba, ngu agwekorere akuratiire Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Kandi omutwe muhango gw'abantu gwamukuratira; gurimu n'abakazi nibamucurira, nibeemaamaata. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu yaabahindukira, yaagira ati: Imwe abaishiki ba Yerusaalemu, mutandirira, kureka mweririre n'abaana baanyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:23">Luk 21:23</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ebiro biryahika ebi barigiriramu bati: Baine omugisha abakazi engumba, n'enda ezitakazaarahoga, n'amabeere agatakontsyaga. <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Kush 6:16</ref>. </char></note> Obwo baryatandika kweshengyereza enshozi nibagira bati: Mutugwere, n'ebibungo bati, Mutushwekyerere. <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:17">1 Pet 4:17</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ku baraabe nibagira bati omuti omubisi, ogwomire gwo baryagugira bata?<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Kandi hakaba hariho abandi babiri, abaabaire bari enkozi z'ebibi, abaatwairwe kwitwa nawe. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33-49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:33-56">Mat 27:33-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:22-41">Mak 15:22-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-30">Yoh 19:17-30</ref>. </char></note> Ku baahikire aha mwanya ogurikwetwa Empanga y'omutwe, aho niho baamubambire hamwe n'ezo nkozi z'ebibi, omwe aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo, n'ondiijo aha rwa bumosho.<verse eid="LUK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:18">Zab 22:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu yaagira ati: Taata, obasaasire, ahakuba tibarikumanya ki barikukora. Baabagana ebijwaro bye, nibabiteerera enteenyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Zab 22:8</ref>. </char></note> Abantu baayemerera aho nibashamaara; n'abategyeki baamutsyorera nibagira bati: Akajuna abandi; ku araabe ari Kristo owa Ruhanga, ou yaatooraine, naayejune. <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Zab 69:21</ref>. </char></note> N'abaserukare nabo baamutsyorera, baija, baamuheereza viinyo erikushaarira, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />nibagira bati: Ku oraabe ori Omugabe w'Abayudaaya, yejune. <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Kandi ahaiguru ye hakaba hariho ekirangiriro ekihandiikirwe kiti: OGU N'OMUGABE W'ABAYUDAAYA.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okweteisa kw'omwe aha bambuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Omwe aha nkozi z'ebibi ezaabambirwe yaamuteerera enaku naagira ati: Tiiwe Kristo? Yejune, naitwe otujune. <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Kwonka ondiijo yaagarukamu naamuteisa ati: Na Ruhanga torikumutiina, ahabw'okushushanisa nawe ekiheneso? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Itwe tukishemereire, ahabw'okuba tutuzirwe ebi twakozire; kwonka ogu we taine ki acumwire. <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Yaagira ati: Yesu, ku oriija omu bukama bwawe, onyijukye. <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Buzimazima ninkugambira nti: Eri izooba noija kuguma naanye omuri <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paradiiso. N'omwanya murungi omu nsi ya Ruhanga, ei abafeereire omuri Kristo baza. </char></note>Paradiiso.<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 8:9">Amo 8:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eshaaha ku zaabaire ziri nka mukaaga, omwirima mwingi gwashweka ensi yoona okuhitsya aha shaaha ya mwenda. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 36:35">Kur 36:35</ref>. </char></note> Omukingo gw'omuri hekalu gwataagukira ahagati. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Zab 31:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:59">Byak 7:59</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaagamba n'eiraka rihango naagira ati: Taata, naata omwoyo gwangye omu mikono yaawe. Ku yaaherize kugamba ekyo, yaahayo amagara ge. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Omukuru w'abaserukare, ku yaareebire ekyabaho, yaahimbisa Ruhanga naagira ati: Buzima omushaija ogu yaaba ari omuntu ohikiriire. <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Kandi abantu boona, abaabaire bateeraniire aho kushamaara, ku baareebire ebyabaho, baagaruka nibeemamaata. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Bagyenzi be boona n'abakazi abaamukuratiire okuruga Galilaaya, baayemerera hangahari, nibabireeba.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuziikwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:50-56: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mak 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh 19:38-42</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi hakaba hariho omushaija orikwetwa Yosefu, owaabaire ari omujwekyerwa omu ishengyero, omuntu murungi kandi ohikiriire. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />(We tarakwataniise nabo omu kuhanuura kwabo n'omuri ekyo eki bakozire.) Akaba ari owa Arimasaaya, tauni y'Abayudaaya, kandi akaba atuura ategyereize, obukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Omushaija ogwo yaaza owa Pilaato, yaashaba omutumbi gwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Yaaguhanura, yaaguzinga omu mwenda gwa bafuta, yaagurambika omu kituuro, ekyarimirwe omu rukiri, ekitakaziikwamuga muntu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ekiro ekyo kikaba kiri eky'Okweteguura; kandi Sabato ekaba neetandika. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />N'abakazi, abaarugire Galilaaya hamwe nawe, baabakuratira, baareeba ekituuro, n'omutumbi gwe oku gwateebwamu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Baagarukayo, baateekateeka eby'emigaju n'amajuta. Ahari Sabato baahuumura, nk'oku ekiragiro kiri.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Okuzooka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mak 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-13">Yoh 20:1-13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro ky'okubanza omuri saabiiti, omushekye nigujuguta, abakazi baaza aha kituuro baine emigaju ei baateekateekire. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Baashanga eibaare rikumbagaziibwe okuruga aha kituuro. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Kwonka ku baatahiremu, tibaashangamu mutumbi gwa Mukama waitu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Ku baabaire bakishobeirwe ahabw'ekyo, reeba, abashaija babiri baayemerera haihi nabo, bajwaire ebijwaro birikumurinkana. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Ku baayekangire, bainika emitwe n'amaisho gaabo ahansi, abashaija abo baababuuza bati: Ahabw'enki nimusherurira ohuriire omu bafu? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Tari aha; azookire. Mwijukye ebi yaabagambiire akiri Galilaaya, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />naagira ati: Omwana w'omuntu ashemereire kuheebwayo omu mikono y'abantu abanyabibi, n'okubambwa aha musharaba, kandi aha kiro kya kashatu okazooka. <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Baijuka ebigambo bye. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Baaruga aha ktuuro, baagarukayo; ebyo byona baabigambira bari ikumi n'omwe n'abandi boona. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Kandi abakazi abaabigambiire entumwa ni Mariamu Magadaleene, na Yoana, na Mariamu nyina wa Yakobo, n'abandi bakazi abaabaire bari hamwe nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Kwonka ebigambo ebyo byabasusira nk'eby'okugana ebitaine mugasho, tibaabiikiriza. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Bwanyima Petero yaimuka, yairuka aha kituuro, yainama, yaaringuriza, yaareeba emyenda ya bafuta eri yonka; yaagaruka omuka, naatangaarira ebibaireho.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okweyoreka babiri omu muhanda ogwa Emau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:13-35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 16:12">Mak 16:12</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba babiri aharibo bakaba nibagyenda, nibaza omu kirorero ekirikwetwa Emau, ekyabaire kiri nka mahiro mushanju okuruga Yerusaalemu; <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />nibagaaniira ahari ebyo byona ebibaireho. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ku baabaire nibagaaniira, nibabuuzana, Yesu we wenka yairira haihi, yaagyenda nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Kwonka amaisho gaabo gaakingirwa ngu barekye kumumanya. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yaababuuza ati: Ni bigambo ki ebi murikugaaniira nimugyenda? Baayemerera, nibareebeka baine enaku. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Omwe aharibo orikwetwa Kuleopa yaagarukamu naamubuuza ati: Omu bagyenyi boona abari omuri Yerusaalemu, niiwe wenka otarikumanya ebibaireho omu biro ebi? <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Ni bigambo ki? Baamugira bati: Ebya Yesu owa Nazareesi, owaabaire ari nabi w'amaani omu bi yaabaire akora n'ebi yaabaire agamba, omu maisho ga Ruhanga n'ag'abantu boona. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Mbwenu abanyamurwa abakuru n'abategyeki baitu bamuhaireyo okucwerwa orubanja rw'okufa, baamubamba aha musharaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:68">Luk 1:68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:38">2:38</ref>. </char></note> Haza itwe tukaba twine amatsiko ngu niwe aricungura Abaisraeli; kandi hamwe n'ebi byona, hati n'ekiro kya kashatu okwiha ahi ebi bibeereireho. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Kandi n'abakazi bamwe ab'owaitu abaaguruka kare munonga kuza aha kituuro, ku baija, baatutangaaza nibagira ngu baashanga omutumbi gwe gutarimu, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />kandi ngu, baabonekyerwa baamaraika abaabagira ngu ariho ahuriire. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Na bagyenzi baitu abamwe baaza aha kituuro, baashanga biri nk'oku abakazi baagamba; kwonka We tibaamureeba. <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yesu yaabagambira ati: Imwe bashema 'mwe, ab'emitima etarikurahuka kwikiriza byona ebi baanabi baagambire! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Timurikumanya ngu Kristo kikamushemerera kubonabonesibwa ebi byona n'okutaaha omu kitiinisa kye? <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Bir 18:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:1-21">Zab 22:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:1-12">Isa 53:1-12</ref>. </char></note> Yaatandikira ahari Musa na baanabi boona, yaabashobororera omu Byahandiikirwe byona ebyamuhandiikirweho. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Batyo bairira haihi n'ekirorero, ei baabaire nibaza; We yaashusha nk'orikwenda kwogaho; <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />kwonka bo baamugyemesereza nibagira bati: Guma naitwe, ahabw'okuba bwaza kwira, n'eizooba ryarengyire. Atyo yaataaha omu nju yaabo kuguma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:19">Luk 22:19</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire ashutami nabo aha by'okurya, yaakwata omugaati, yaagusiimira, yaagubega, yaagubaheereza. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Amaisho gaabo gaiguka, baamumanya; yaaburira aho, tibaamureeba. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Baagambirana bati: Emitima yaitu tiyaashashaanuka, obu yaaba naagamba naitwe omu muhanda, naatushuururira Ebyahandiikirwe? <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Omu shaaha egyo baimuka, baagaruka Yerusaalemu baashanga bari ikumi n'omwe bateeraine na bagyenzi baabo abandi: <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:4">1 Kor 15:4</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 15:5">5</ref>. </char></note> baahurira nibahamya bati: Mukama waitu Yesu yaazooka, kandi yaabonekyera na Simooni. <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />N'abo ababiri baabatekyerereza eby'omu muhanda, kandi ku baamumanyira aha kubega omugaati.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okweyoreka abeegi be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:36-49: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mak 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20:19-23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibagamba ebyo, Yesu we wenka yaayemerera ahagati yaabo, yaabaigira ati: Mugire obusingye! <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:26">Mat 14:26</ref>. </char></note> Baayekanga, baatiina, baateekateeka ngu baareeba omuzimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Yaababuuza ati: N'enki ekyabeemereza emitima, kandi n'okubanganisa kwaizira ki omu mitima yaanyu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mureebe engaro zangye n'ebigyere byangye, mumanye ngu niinye buzima; munkoreho, mureebe, ahakuba omuzimu tigugira mubiri n'amagufa, nk'ebi mwandeeba nabyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ku yaaherize kugamba ebyo, yaabooreka engaro ze n'ebigyere bye. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Ku baabaire batakaikiriize ahabw'okushemererwa n'okutangaara, yaabagira ati: Beitu aha mwineho eky'okurya? <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:5">Yoh 21:5</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 21:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Baamuha ekicweka ky'eky'enyanja kitarikire; <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />yaakyakiira, yaakiriira omu maisho gaabo.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuraga abeegi be n'okutemba omu iguru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Yaabagira ati: Ebi nibyo bigambo byangye ebi naabagambiire nkiri hamwe naimwe, ngu byona bishemereire kuhikiirizibwa ebyampandiikirweho omu biragiro bya Musa n'omu bya baanabi n'omuri zaaburi. <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Atyo yaashuuruura obwengye bwabo, ngu bashoborokyerwe Ebyahandiikirwe; <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:16">1 Tim 3:16</ref>. </char></note> yaabagira ati: Oku nikwo kyahandiikirwe ngu Kristo ashemereire kubonabonesibwa, n'okuzooka omu bafu aha kiro kya kashatu; <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />kandi ngu okweteisa n'okwihwaho ebibi bishemereire kubuurirwa omu iziina rye omu mahanga goona, okutandikira Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Imwe muri baakareebi b'ebigambo ebyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Byak 1:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, niinyija kubooherereza eki Tata yaaraganiise; kwonka mugume omu rurembo okuhitsya obu murijwekwa amaani agarikuruga omu iguru.<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:50-53: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mak 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:4-14">Byak 1:4-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaabeebembera, yaabahitsya haihi na Besania, yaimutsya emikono ye, yaabaha omugisha. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ku yaabaire naakibaha omugisha, yaabatsigaho, yaatwarwa omu iguru. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:22">Yoh 16:22</ref>. </char></note> Baamuramya, baagaruka Yerusaalemu n'okushemererwa kwingi; <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />kandi obutoosha baaguma nibaija omuri hekalu, nibasiima Ruhanga.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>